rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the spell is not countered (because the spell it targets can\'t be countered), then it does not get exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card does not go to the graveyard before being exiled.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be sacrificed for its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire deals nonlethal damage to a creature and then a different effect or damage source causes that creature to be put into a graveyard later in the turn, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger and it will get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Each time a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, check whether Sengir Vampire had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger. It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If Sengir Vampire and a creature it dealt damage to are both put into a graveyard at the same time, Sengir Vampire\'s ability will trigger, but it will do nothing when it resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Destroying a blocking creature won\'t cause any of the creatures it was blocking to become unblocked. They won\'t deal combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker (unless they have trample)."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent is an illegal target by the time Solemn Offering would resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Terra Stomper can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Cancel). Those spells will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Terra Stomper won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If Garruk’s Packleader and another creature with power 3 or greater enter the battlefield under your control at the same time, the ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability checks the power of each creature as it enters the battlefield. It will take into account counters the permanent enters the battlefield with and static abilities that affect its power (such as Flinthoof Boar’s ability). After the creature is on the battlefield, raising its power with a spell (such as Titanic Growth), an activated ability, or a triggered ability won’t cause this ability to retroactively trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The creature’s power is checked only to see if the ability triggers. It doesn’t matter what the creature’s power is when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel and the permanent would be destroyed simultaneously, only Aegis Angel will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Aegis Angel leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Aegis Angel, the permanent will no longer have indestructible, even if you regain control of Aegis Angel.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Selfless Cathar’s ability resolves will be affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn will not.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can activate Selfless Cathar’s ability even if you control no other creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Discarding a card is part of the cost to activate Rummaging Goblin\'s ability. If you don\'t have a card in your hand, you can\'t pay this part of the cost and you can\'t activate the ability."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Roaring Primadox’s ability is mandatory. When it resolves, if Roaring Primadox is the only creature you control, you must return it to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t target any creature. You choose which one to return when the ability resolves. No player can respond to this choice once the ability starts resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can cast Mind Sculpt no matter how many cards are in the opponent’s library. If there are fewer than seven, the opponent will put all of them into their graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t play will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Playing a card this way follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Under normal circumstances, you can play a land card exiled with Act on Impulse only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability\'s activation cost. A player can\'t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If Stormtide Leviathan loses its abilities, all lands on the battlefield (including those that enter the battlefield later on) will still be Islands in addition to their other types and will still be able to tap to produce {U}. The way continuous effects work, Stormtide Leviathan\'s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Islandwalk cares about lands with the land type Island, not necessarily lands named Island.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Stormtide Leviathan\\\'s second ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Island. Each land thus has the ability "{T}: Add {U}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, other abilities, and whether they\\\'re legendary or basic.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Stormtide Leviathan\'s third ability affects all creatures with neither flying nor islandwalk, regardless of who controls them. They can\'t attack any player or planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If an effect puts two or more cards on the top or bottom of a library at the same time, the owner of those cards may arrange them in any order. That library\'s owner doesn\'t reveal the order in which the cards go into their library."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The owner of each attacking creature chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of their library. The active player (the player whose turn it is) makes all of their choices first, followed by each other player in turn order.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Chasm Skulker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Squid tokens you get. For example, if there are two +1/+1 counters on Chasm Skulker and it gets three -1/-1 counters, you\'ll get two Squid tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'If you draw multiple cards, the first ability will trigger that many times. Each of these abilities will cause a +1/+1 counter to be put on Chasm Skulker.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'A mana ability is an ability that (1) could put mana into a player’s mana pool when it resolves, (2) isn’t a loyalty ability, and (3) doesn’t target.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If paying the activation cost of the ability includes sacrificing Kurkesh, the ability won’t be copied. At the time the ability is considered activated (after all costs are paid), Kurkesh is no longer on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the ability has {X} in its cost, the value of X is copied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the ability is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the ability it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards (unless they’re Theros block cards with the bestow ability). Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Constricting Sliver gives Slivers you control an ability that causes a zone change with a duration, a newer style of ability that’s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Oblivion Ring. However, unlike Oblivion Ring’s abilities, this ability creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after the Sliver leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a Sliver leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a Sliver you control leaves the battlefield, only the card that particular Sliver exiled will return to the battlefield. Each card exiled by another Sliver will remain exiled until that Sliver leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if the Sliver’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The Sliver that enters the battlefield is the source of the ability that exiles the creature. For example, if a blue Sliver enters the battlefield under your control, the ability can target and exile a creature with protection from white.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after the Sliver leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. The two creatures aren’t on the battlefield at the same time. For example, if the returning creature is a Mercurial Pretender, it can’t enter the battlefield as a copy of the Sliver.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card will return even if the Sliver whose ability exiled it doesn’t have that ability at the time (perhaps because Constricting Sliver is no longer on the battlefield).'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The exiled card will return to the battlefield under its owner’s control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When Constricting Sliver enters the battlefield, the ability it gives itself will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Damage dealt to a Sliver with indestructible is still marked on that creature. If it has lethal damage marked on it and it loses indestructible (perhaps because Sliver Hivelord leaves the battlefield), it will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The granted ability applies to any spell (including Aura spells), activated ability, or triggered ability that’s controlled by an opponent that targets a Sliver you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like indestructible and the ability granted by Belligerent Sliver, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you change the creature type of a Sliver you control so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Slivers in this set affect only Sliver creatures you control. They don’t grant bonuses to your opponents’ Slivers. This is the same way Slivers from the Magic 2014 core set worked, while Slivers in earlier sets granted bonuses to all Slivers.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield,” such as choosing a creature to copy with Mercurial Pretender, are also unaffected.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Hushwing Gryff’s ability stops a creature’s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that would trigger when a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Hushwing Gryff and another creature enter the battlefield at the same time, neither creature entering the battlefield will cause triggered abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Look at the permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger. For example, if you control March of the Machines, which says, in part, “Each noncreature artifact is an artifact creature,” each artifact will be a creature at the time it enters the battlefield and will not cause triggered abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The trigger event doesn’t have to specify “creatures” entering the battlefield. For example, Amulet of Vigor says “Whenever a permanent enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, untap it.” If a creature enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, Amulet of Vigor’s ability would not trigger. If a land (that isn’t also a creature) enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, Amulet of Vigor’s ability would trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts. Static and triggered abilities are unaffected by Oppressive Rays.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "The enchanted creature\'s controller can choose to not attack or block with it even if it must attack or block if able. Players can\'t be forced to pay a cost to attack or block."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Activating the ability after blockers have been declared won’t have any effect. It won’t change or undo any blocks.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'After the last ability resolves, you’ll essentially be able to activate a loyalty ability of each planeswalker you control a total of twice during your turn. The timing rules for when you can activate loyalty abilities apply each time; it must be your main phase and the stack must be empty.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because the last ability modifies the rules of the game, it affects not only planeswalkers you control when it resolves, but also planeswalkers that come under your control later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each additional time The Chain Veil’s last ability resolves will allow you to activate a loyalty ability of each planeswalker you control an additional time. For example, if you activate The Chain Veil’s last ability, untap it, then activate it again, you can activate a loyalty ability of a planeswalker you control three times that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'For the first ability, it doesn’t matter whether the planeswalker is still on the battlefield as your end step begins. If you activated one of its loyalty abilities that turn, The Chain Veil’s triggered ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The second loyalty ability you activate doesn’t have to be the same as the first ability. For example, you could activate a planeswalker’s first ability twice, or you could activate a planeswalker’s first ability, then activate its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Aggressive Mining doesn’t stop lands from being put onto the battlefield by a spell or ability. It only stops the special action of playing a land.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the ability once on each player’s turn, not just your own.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Although Auras that are already attached to the creature aren’t affected by Spectra Ward, the enchanted creature can’t be the target of further Aura spells that have one or more colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The protection granted by Spectra Ward won’t cause any Aura to be put into its owner’s graveyard, including Spectra Ward itself. However, if the enchanted creature gains protection from white in another way, Spectra Ward will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Although Goblin Rabblemaster doesn’t force itself to attack, if you control two of them, they’ll force each other to attack if able.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, a creature that must attack if able is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under your control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, you’re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The number of attacking Goblins is counted as the last ability resolves, and the bonus is locked in at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Although you may choose a land card in your hand, you won’t be able to play it even if the player guessed wrong.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. Notably, you can’t cast a card with bestow as an Aura this way. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you don’t cast the card, either because the player guessed right or because you choose not to cast it, you don’t have to reveal it. Your opponent won’t know the reason you didn’t cast the card.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'To choose a card in your hand, clearly separate it from the rest of your hand without revealing it.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You cast the card in your hand as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” are not.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If the card is a split card, its converted mana cost is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If the player guesses wrong and you cast a split card this way, you may cast either half (or both halves if the card has fuse), no matter what its converted mana cost is.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Although you must control no creatures to activate the “animation” ability, having a creature somehow come under your control in response to that ability won’t stop it from resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'It’s possible to activate the first activated ability of Haunted Plate Mail in response to activating the first ability of another Haunted Plate Mail and have them both become creatures until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the equip ability of Haunted Plate Mail while it isn’t an Equipment, but the ability will have no effect. Haunted Plate Mail won’t become attached to any creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Any abilities of the Soldier creature card that trigger “Whenever [this creature] attacks” won’t trigger because the creature was never declared as an attacking creature.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You choose what the Soldier you put onto the battlefield is attacking. It doesn’t have to attack the same player or planeswalker as Preeminent Captain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Mercurial Pretender enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Mercurial Pretender somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Mercurial Pretender can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Genesis Hydra), X is 0.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Mercurial Pretender copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Mercurial Pretender is not a token, even when copying one.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Mercurial Pretender), then Mercurial Pretender enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature is copying (plus any abilities it gained as part of the copying process, if applicable).'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Mercurial Pretender copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, etc. For example, if Mercurial Pretender enters the battlefield as a copy of a Profane Memento with Ensoul Artifact attached to it, Mercurial Pretender will be a noncreature Profane Memento with Mercurial Pretender’s added activated ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Mercurial Pretender’s ability doesn’t target the chosen creature.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The activated ability Mercurial Pretender gives itself becomes part of its copiable values. Unless the ability is overwritten by another copy effect, a creature that’s a copy of Mercurial Pretender will have that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Mercurial Pretender enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'As long as Seraph of the Masses is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Seraph of the Masses\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'As soon as Inferno Fist leaves the battlefield, its power bonus stops applying. This means that if you sacrifice Inferno Fist before combat damage is dealt, perhaps to destroy a potential blocker, the creature that was enchanted won’t have the bonus when it deals combat damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If another player gains control of the enchanted creature, or if Inferno Fist becomes attached to a creature another player controls, Inferno Fist will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the target permanent or player is an illegal target when Covenant of Blood tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain any life. (Any creatures you tapped to cast Covenant of Blood remain tapped.)'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The rules for convoke have changed slightly since it last appeared in an expansion. Previously, convoke reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under current rules, you tap creatures at the same time you pay the spell’s costs. Tapping a creature this way is simply another way to pay.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}{G}.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The rules for convoke have changed slightly since it last appeared in an expansion. Previously, convoke reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under current rules, you tap creatures at the same time you pay the spell’s costs. Tapping a creature this way is simply another way to pay.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}{G}.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can leave any cards with that name in the zone they’re in. You don’t have to exile them.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The rules for convoke have changed slightly since it last appeared in an expansion. Previously, convoke reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under current rules, you tap creatures at the same time you pay the spell’s costs. Tapping a creature this way is simply another way to pay.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}{G}.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because you’re casting the copies “without paying their mana costs,” you can’t pay any alternative costs for the copies. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the copies have any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the copied card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value when casting the copies.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the first ability resolves but the damage is prevented or redirected, the target creature still won’t be able to block that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you exile a land card using the second ability, you may play that land only if you have any available land plays. Normally, this means you can play the land only if you haven’t played a land yet that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'In the third ability, “exiled this way” means the cards you just exiled because of that ability resolving. Cards exiled with the second ability or with previous activations of the third ability don’t count.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The card exiled by the second ability is exiled face up. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if it’s a creature card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'To activate the first ability, you must target a player but you can choose to not target any creatures.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'While casting the copies created by the third ability, timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” are not.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'While resolving the third ability, you create the copies of the card in exile and cast them from exile. You can cast zero, one, two, or all three copies. The card itself isn’t cast. It remains exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Blastfire Bolt can target any creature, not just one with Equipment attached to it. The damage will be dealt to the creature even if it doesn’t have any Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Blastfire Bolt tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No Equipment will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Both activated abilities prevent all damage of the chosen color, not just combat damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'For each activated ability, you choose the color as the ability resolves. However, the color of a source that would deal damage to the permanent or player is checked only when it would deal that damage, not as Avacyn’s ability resolves. For example, if you choose blue, damage a blue creature would deal is prevented, even if that creature wasn’t blue (or wasn’t on the battlefield) when Avacyn’s ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Neither activated ability has any effect on damage that’s already been dealt.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The possible color choices are white, blue, black, red, and green. You can’t choose artifact, colorless, or any other word.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Whether the target permanent or player is still a legal target is no longer checked after the appropriate ability resolves. For example, if a creature targeted by the first ability gains protection from white after the ability resolves but before it prevents damage, the effect will still prevent damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Brood Keeper’s ability triggers both whenever an Aura enters the battlefield attached to Brood Keeper and whenever an Aura on the battlefield attached to a different object becomes attached to Brood Keeper.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If an Aura becomes attached to Brood Keeper that causes another player to gain control of it, that player will control the triggered ability that creates a Dragon.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Causing a creature to gain flying after it’s been blocked won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Circle of Flame’s ability triggers only if a creature without flying is declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step. If a creature with flying attacks you or a planeswalker you control and then loses flying, or if a creature without flying is put onto the battlefield attacking you or a planeswalker you control, the ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-02-01', 'text': 'Circle of Flame is banned in Pauper (not just non-legal), due to a special case on MTGO: https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/january-21-2019-banned-and-restricted-announcement'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Creatures that enter the battlefield or come under the target player’s control after Polymorphist’s Jest resolves won’t be affected.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creatures no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change their power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the Theros block Gods is affected by Polymorphist’s Jest, it will be a legendary 1/1 blue Frog enchantment creature with no abilities. If it stops being a creature, perhaps because your devotion to its color(s) decreased, it will be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities. The way continuous effects work, the God’s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the affected creatures gains an ability after Polymorphist’s Jest resolves, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Polymorphist’s Jest doesn’t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, there is no way to cast this spell to stop a creature’s ability that says “At the beginning of your upkeep,” “When this creature enters the battlefield,” or similar from triggering.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Polymorphist’s Jest overwrites all previous effects that set the creatures’ base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Polymorphist’s Jest resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creatures will lose all other colors and creature types, but they will retain any other card types (such as artifact) or supertypes (such as legendary) they may have.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Damage dealt to an opponent causes that player to lose that much life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Feast on the Fallen checks only if an opponent lost life during the turn, not whether that player’s life total decreased over the course of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life last turn, Feast on the Fallen’s ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Feast on the Fallen looks at the entire previous turn to determine whether its ability triggers or not. It doesn’t matter whether Feast on the Fallen was on the battlefield when the opponent lost life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Only one +1/+1 counter will be put on the target creature no matter how much life was lost.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each attacking creature is a separate source of damage. For example, if two 3/3 creatures attack you and are unblocked, the emblem will prevent 2 damage from each creature. You’ll be dealt a total of 2 damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is both a creature and a planeswalker, Ajani’s second ability will put both a +1/+1 counter and a loyalty counter on it.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage is dealt, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Dictate of the Twin Gods says, “If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.” Suppose you would be dealt 3 damage while Dictate of the Twin Gods is on the battlefield and you control Ajani’s emblem. You can either (a) prevent all but 1 damage first and then let Dictate of the Twin Gods’s effect double that, for a result of being dealt 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 6 and then prevent all but 1 of that damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The emblem’s ability doesn’t consider who controls the source dealing damage to you or a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You may activate the first ability with no targets. If you do, you simply put a loyalty counter on Ajani to pay the cost of the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each of the three targets must be different. If there aren’t three different legal targets available, you can’t cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one or two of Cone of Flame’s targets are illegal when it resolves, you can’t change how much damage will be dealt to the remaining legal targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each of these artifacts cares about any land with the appropriate basic land type. For example, Staff of the Sun Magus’s ability triggers when any land with the subtype Plains enters the battlefield under your control, not just lands named Plains.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you cast a copy of a card that’s a certain color, the appropriate Staff’s ability will trigger. However, if you copy a spell on the stack without casting that copy, it will not.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Most nonbasic lands don’t have basic land types, even if they produce colored mana. For example, Caves of Koilos is neither a Plains nor a Swamp. Having one enter the battlefield under your control won’t cause Staff of the Sun Magus’s ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the Theros block Gods is affected by Turn to Frog, it will be a legendary 1/1 blue Frog enchantment creature with no abilities. If it stops being a creature, perhaps because your devotion to its color(s) decreased, it will be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities. The way continuous effects work, the God’s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Turn to Frog resolves, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creature will lose all other colors and creature types, but it will retain any other card types (such as artifact) or supertypes (such as legendary) it may have.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog doesn’t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, there is no way to cast this spell to stop a creature’s ability that says “At the beginning of your upkeep,” “When this creature enters the battlefield,” or similar from triggering.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Turn to Frog resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Titanic Growth or a +1/+1 counter, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will each become 5. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Ensoul Artifact becomes attached to the artifact will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has. Notably, if an Equipment becomes an artifact creature, it can’t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it’s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn’t matter how long it’s been a creature, just how long it’s been on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Enchantment creatures with bestow from the Theros block aren’t Aura cards in your library. You can’t find one with Heliod’s Pilgrim.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability’s activation cost. A player can’t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'To activate either ability, you must target a player, but you can choose to not target any creatures.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability’s activation cost. A player can’t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'To determine how many cards to draw, count the number of colors among permanents you control as either activated ability resolves. You’ll draw between zero and five cards.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability’s activation cost. A player can’t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Forge Devil’s ability is mandatory. If it’s the only creature on the battlefield, you’ll have to choose it as the target and have it deal 1 damage to itself and 1 damage to you.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability can target any creature an opponent controls, not just one that’s tapped.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability will check its condition again as it tries to resolve. If, at that time, another player controls a creature with the greatest power or tied for the greatest power, the ability won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability will trigger only if you control each creature on the battlefield with the greatest power as the beginning of combat step begins. If another player controls a creature with the greatest power or tied for the greatest power at that time, the ability won’t trigger at all.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': '“Each creature on the battlefield with the greatest power” may be a single creature if each other creature has less power.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Hornet Nest’s triggered ability will trigger even if it’s dealt lethal damage. For example, if it’s dealt 7 damage, its ability will trigger and you’ll put seven Insect creature tokens onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Blood Host isn’t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, you won’t put a +1/+1 counter on it but you’ll still gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Boonweaver Giant isn’t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, you can’t put any Aura onto the battlefield. You may still search the appropriate zones and shuffle your library, if applicable.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The Aura card must be able to legally enchant Boonweaver Giant. For example, you can’t put an Aura with enchant land onto the battlefield this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Grindclock isn’t on the battlefield when its last ability resolves, use the number of charge counters on it when it left the battlefield to determine how many cards to put into the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Profane Memento is put into your graveyard at the same time as a creature card is put into an opponent’s graveyard, its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Profane Memento’s ability will trigger when a nontoken creature you control but an opponent owns dies.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Token creatures dying won’t cause Profane Memento’s ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Undergrowth Scavenger enters the battlefield from a graveyard, it will count itself when determining how many +1/+1 counters it enters with.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Yisan isn’t on the battlefield when its ability resolves, use the number of verse counters on it when it left the battlefield to determine which creature cards may be put onto the battlefield. This number will include the counter you put on Yisan to activate the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a combat phase has two combat damage steps (because there’s an attacker or blocker with first strike or double strike), Altac Bloodseeker may gain first strike during the first one. If this happens, it will assign combat damage in the second combat damage step along with other creatures that haven’t assigned combat damage during that combat.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the ability triggers multiple times in a single turn, the power bonuses are cumulative, but the additional instances of first strike and haste are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature loses double strike after dealing combat damage in the first combat damage step, it won’t assign combat damage in the second one.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a player has no cards in their hand and no cards in their graveyard when the third ability resolves, that player won’t shuffle their library.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When the first ability resolves, the card you don’t put into your graveyard stays on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage is dealt, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Dictate of the Twin Gods says, “If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.” Suppose the equipped creature would be dealt 3 damage while Dictate of the Twin Gods is on the battlefield and you control two creatures. You can either (a) prevent 2 damage first and then let Dictate of the Twin Gods’s effect apply, for a result of the equipped creature being dealt 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 6 and then prevent 2 damage, for a result of the creature being dealt 4 damage.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'To determine how much damage to prevent, use the number of creatures you control when damage would be dealt, including the equipped creature. Notably, if damage would be dealt to multiple creatures at the same time, you’ll count the number of creatures you control before any of that damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature isn’t tapped during its controller’s next untap step (perhaps because it was untapped by a spell), Wall of Frost’s ability has no effect at that time. It won’t try to keep the creature tapped on subsequent turns.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Wall of Frost’s ability tracks the creature, not the creature’s controller. That is, if the creature changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Divine Favor is an illegal target when Divine Favor tries to resolve, Divine Favor won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the land targeted by Verdant Haven is an illegal target when Verdan Haven tries to resolve, Verdant Haven won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the land targeted by the first ability entered the battlefield this turn, it won’t be able to attack and its activated abilities with {T} in the cost (including its mana ability) can’t be activated (unless something gives it haste). The same is true for the lands put onto the battlefield with the third ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The type-changing effects of the first and third abilities don’t have a duration. They last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the only Mountains on the battlefield leave the battlefield after Glacial Crasher attacks, it stays attacking.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter who controls the Mountain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the opponent controls no creatures when the first triggered ability resolves, that player still loses 10 life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Ob Nixilis’s first triggered ability won’t trigger if you search an opponent’s library or if an opponent searches another player’s library.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The first triggered ability won’t be put on the stack until after the spell or ability causing the opponent to search their library finishes resolving. Notably, if that spell or ability causes any other abilities to trigger (for example, if the opponent searched for a creature card and put it onto the battlefield), those abilities and Ob Nixilis’s triggered ability will go on the stack together. The active player puts all of their abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last ability put onto the stack this way will be the first to resolve, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you activate the third ability, and the target creature is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The emblem is owned and controlled by the target of the ability that created it. In a multiplayer game, if Garruk’s owner leaves the game, the emblem does not.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The emblem’s ability won’t trigger if a creature attacks a planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The first ability can target and destroy a Garruk planeswalker controlled by another player.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you control no other creatures when the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, you must sacrifice Quickling.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If you gain life at the same time Wall of Limbs is dealt lethal damage (probably because you control a blocking creature with lifelink), Wall of Limbs’s triggered ability will trigger, but Wall of Limbs will be destroyed before the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Soulmender or 8 life from Meditation Puzzle.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Use Wall of Limbs’s power as it last existed on the battlefield, including any +1/+1 counters it had, to determine the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If your life total is less than your starting life total, you actually gain the appropriate amount of life. Other effects that interact with life gain will interact with Resolute Archangel’s ability accordingly.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Your starting life total is the life total you began the game with. For most two-player formats, this is 20. For Two-Headed Giant, it’s the life total your team started with, usually 30. In Commander games, your starting life total is 40.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whether the other spell resolved. It could have been countered or, if you’ve somehow cast Illusory Angel as though it had flash, it could still be on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Multiple instances of convoke on a single spell are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on a creature are redundant. Giving the same creature lifelink more than once won’t cause its controller to gain additional life.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Once Scuttling Doom Engine has been blocked by a creature, reducing that creature’s power to 2 or less won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Once the ability triggers, it doesn’t matter how many creatures are still attacking when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creatures don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Phytotitan’s ability will return it to the battlefield only if it’s still in the graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves. If it’s not, it won’t return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the artifact you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one artifact to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without sacrificing an artifact, and you can’t sacrifice additional artifacts.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Rotfeaster Maggot’s ability is mandatory. If you are the only player with creature cards in your graveyard, you must target one of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Static and triggered abilities are unaffected by Encrust.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The permanent can be untapped by other spells and abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The Land Mine tokens have the ability even if Goblin Kaboomist blows himself up or otherwise leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You flip the coin after the Land Mine token is created, not after you sacrifice a Land Mine. The token is created even if you lose the flip.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t target any permanent. You choose which one to return when the ability resolves. No player can respond to this choice once the ability starts resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability that defines Kalonian Twingrove’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The power and toughness of both Kalonian Twingrove and the token it creates will change as the number of Forests you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The choice of creature type is made as Obelisk of Urd enters the battlefield. Players can’t respond to this choice. The bonus starts applying immediately.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Worldsoul Colossus (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{W}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{W}. If you tap two green creatures and two white creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You can tap an untapped creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn to convoke a spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The declare blockers step is the last chance to cast Devouring Light before creatures deal their combat damage. However, a creature remains an attacking or blocking creature during the combat damage step and end of combat step. Devouring Light may be cast targeting such a creature during those steps, after the creature has dealt combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "You can tap untapped attacking or blocking creatures you control to help cast Devouring Light. This doesn\'t remove those creatures from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The prevention effect will apply to any combat damage that would be dealt this turn by a nongreen creature, even if that creature was green or wasn’t on the battlefield when Hunter’s Ambush resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The triggered ability will trigger for any creature entering the battlefield under your control at the same time as Kapsho Kitefins.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Wall of Essence’s triggered ability will trigger even if it’s dealt lethal damage. For example, if it’s dealt 7 combat damage, its ability will trigger and you’ll gain 7 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Warden of the Beyond can’t get more than +2/+2 from its last ability, no matter how many opponents own a card in exile or how many exiled cards they own.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Whether you control a Sliver is checked only when you activate the last ability, not as that ability resolves. If you control no Slivers at the time the ability resolves, you’ll still get a Sliver token.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Whether you control a blue creature is checked only when Statute of Denial resolves. If you do, drawing and discarding a card is mandatory. You can’t choose to not do it.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if Vineweft is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can remove any +1/+1 counters from Cruel Sadist to activate its second ability, not just those put on Cruel Sadist by its first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Spirit to activate the last ability, not just a Spirit token created by Spirit Bonds.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {W} as the triggered ability resolves. You may only pay {W} and create a Spirit token once per nontoken creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Inspired Charge is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +2/+1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Genesis Hydra\'s first ability will resolve before Genesis Hydra does. Notably, if you put an Aura card onto the battlefield this way, it can\'t enchant Genesis Hydra."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If "the rest" is zero cards, either because X was 0 or because X was 1 and that card was put onto the battlefield, the library is still shuffled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura onto the battlefield this way, you choose what it enchants as it enters the battlefield. This doesn\'t target any permanent or player, but it must be able to enchant that permanent or player. For example, you could put a green Aura onto the battlefield enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, but not one with protection from green."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hoarding Dragon’s two abilities are linked. The second ability refers only to the card exiled by that Hoarding Dragon’s first ability. In other words, each Dragon has its own hoard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Hoarding Dragon dies before its first ability resolves, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve. If you choose to exile an artifact card from your library, it will be exiled indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The artifact card you find is exiled face up. All players can see what it is.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time as a creature an opponent controls, they’re destroyed at the same time. It won’t receive a +1/+1 counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If there are no legal targets to choose, perhaps because all your opponents have hexproof, the ability is removed from the stack with no effect. You won’t draw a card. This is also true if the target opponent becomes an illegal target in response to the ability.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The opponent chooses whether they sacrifice a creature, pays 3 life, or allows you to draw a card. That player can’t make an impossible choice, such as sacrificing a creature while they control no creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The loss of life isn’t a cost. If the target creature is an illegal target when Ulcerate tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t lose any life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak resolves, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak tries to resolve, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it. If that creature is a legal target but the other creature isn\'t, you\'ll still put the counter on the creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Hunt the Weak unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Frenzied Goblin\'s ability has only one target. You can\'t pay {R} multiple times to stop multiple creatures from blocking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If your library has no nonlegendary creature cards in it, you\'ll reveal all the cards in your library, then put them in a random order. Although this is not technically shuffling your library, no player is allowed to know the order of those cards and you will randomize the cards in your deck."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Worldsoul Colossus (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{W}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{W}. If you tap two green creatures and two white creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You can tap an untapped creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn to convoke a spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'An instant or sorcery spell is not a creature spell, even if that spell creates creature tokens.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature spell has generic mana only in its alternative or additional cost, the creature will still gain haste.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the mana is spent on a noncreature spell that becomes a creature later in the turn, that creature won’t have haste.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the mana is spent on two different creature spells, each of those spells (and resulting creatures) will gain haste until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Frost Lynx’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you\'ll have to pay {1}{G}."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form "Cost: Effect." Some keywords are activated abilities (such as equip) and will have colons in their reminder texts. Static and triggered abilities of sources with the chosen name are unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Phyrexian Revoker\'s ability affects sources with the chosen name no matter what zone they are in. For example, a cycling ability of a card with the chosen name can\'t be activated from hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to you causes you to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "First Response checks only if you lost life during the turn, not whether your life total decreased over the course of the turn. For example, if you lost 2 life and then gained 8 life last turn, First Response\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "First Response looks at the entire previous turn to determine whether its ability triggers or not. It doesn\'t matter whether First Response was on the battlefield when you lost life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Only one Soldier will be created no matter how much life was lost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The Soldier won\'t be able to attack the turn it\'s created (unless something gives it haste)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The enchanted creature is the source of the activated ability, not Burning Anger. For example, if the enchanted creature is green, you could activate the ability choosing a creature with protection from red as the target.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Use the power of the enchanted creature as the activated ability resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. If the creature isn\'t on the battlefield at that time, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect such as that of Magus of the Moon causes Urborg to lose its abilities by setting it to a basic land type not in addition to its other types, it won\'t turn lands into Swamps, no matter in what order those effects started to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Land cards not on the battlefield aren\'t Swamps while Urborg is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Urborg\\\'s ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Swamp. Any land that\\\'s a Swamp has the ability "{T}: Add {B}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, other abilities, and whether they\\\'re legendary, basic, or snow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth isn\'t a Swamp while it\'s not on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Paradise Plume or 2 life from Mycologist.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If Juggernaut can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under your control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you\'re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures as Congregate resolves to determine how much life is gained.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aaskrähe\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)\\nDie Aaskrähe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn sich Aas von Aas ernährt, drohen dunkle Tage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be50566e-e03c-41b6-ad06-450d72099fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 384053}, \'multiverseid\': 384053}, {\'name\': \'Cuervo carroñero\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)\\nEl Cuervo carroñero entra al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando la carroña se alimenta de carroña, se acercan días oscuros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a1717b-0805-4589-ba34-820377e6629e\', \'multiverseId\': 386041}, \'multiverseid\': 386041}, {\'name\': \'Corbeau charognard\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)\\nLe Corbeau charognard arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et oiseau\', \'flavor\': "La charogne qui se repaît de charognes présage l\'arrivée des jours sombres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d45baba-c9ea-4731-9c25-b17ff96ee8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 384337}, \'multiverseid\': 384337}, {\'name\': \'Corvo Necrofago\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)\\nIl Corvo Necrofago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Quando le carogne si nutrono di altri cadaveri, si prospettano tempi bui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55454b28-eda6-4aeb-8cd2-899c70996a93\', \'multiverseId\': 384621}, \'multiverseid\': 384621}, {\'name\': \'屍食いカラス\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n屍食いカラスはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・鳥\', \'flavor\': \'屍肉が屍肉を漁るようになったとき、暗黒の日々の到来は近い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7dd4f9d-d3b5-4b54-9f70-eebef336419e\', \'multiverseId\': 384905}, \'multiverseid\': 384905}, {\'name\': \'시체 까마귀\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n시체 까마귀는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 조류\', \'flavor\': \'시체가 시체를 먹는 일이 일어나면 어두운 날들이 찾아올 징조다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'342e76ab-4f8e-4f40-a14e-63f1858b895c\', \'multiverseId\': 385189}, \'multiverseid\': 385189}, {\'name\': \'Corvo Carniceiro\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)\\nCorvo Carniceiro entra no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Quando um carniceiro se alimenta de outro carniceiro, é sinal de que dias difíceis se aproximam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7591ddc9-cd6f-4fe3-b5da-abe169de6c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 385473}, \'multiverseid\': 385473}, {\'name\': \'Ворон-Падальщик\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)\\nВорон-Падальщик выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Если падаль питается падалью, то это значит, что надвигаются черные дни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a8def82-a3f6-4e8c-a102-4c0c4eaac529\', \'multiverseId\': 385757}, \'multiverseid\': 385757}, {\'name\': \'腐肉乌鸦\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）\\n腐肉乌鸦须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／鸟\', \'flavor\': \'当腐肉以腐肉为食时，苦难岁月就迫近了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8cee80-125a-42d4-8b5f-db5bf5d4b683\', \'multiverseId\': 383485}, \'multiverseid\': 383485}, {\'name\': \'腐肉烏鴉\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）\\n腐肉烏鴉須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／鳥\', \'flavor\': \'當腐肉以腐肉為食時，苦難歲月就迫近了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4392a913-3e67-448f-8918-c6bd55bff651\', \'multiverseId\': 383769}, \'multiverseid\': 383769}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Was du versuchst, ist nicht gegen das Gesetz. Allerdings ist es äußerst dumm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95932b7-e07d-453c-9d40-56485b524ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 384013}, \'multiverseid\': 384013}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que intentas hacer no va contra la ley. Sin embargo, es muy tonto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25415dc7-f977-4e0c-bc75-f64e8b99aa6b\', \'multiverseId\': 386001}, \'multiverseid\': 386001}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce que vous tentez n\'est pas interdit par la loi. Cependant, c\'est extrêmement stupide. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b62db1f-e5af-4580-986c-9967988fec39\', \'multiverseId\': 384297}, \'multiverseid\': 384297}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quello che stai tentando non è contro la legge. Però, è decisamente sciocco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b45a46bc-13e0-4e70-9d7c-4f9b7cfe5b44\', \'multiverseId\': 384581}, \'multiverseid\': 384581}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前のやりたいことが理屈に逆らってるってわけじゃない。ただ、ものすごく馬鹿げてるってだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ac930ed-217c-4858-91e6-577a0f052c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 384865}, \'multiverseid\': 384865}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네가 하려는 일이 불법은 아니다. 하지만 매우 어리석어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ea1ede-35b4-4297-9abe-dbe31dd29f1b\', \'multiverseId\': 385149}, \'multiverseid\': 385149}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você está tentando fazer não é contra a lei. Porém, é uma tolice extrema."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd5453b-b6a5-4350-8f7e-584a87f26e76\', \'multiverseId\': 385433}, \'multiverseid\': 385433}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что ты пытаешься сделать, не запрещено законом. Тем не менее, это крайне глупо».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2152da41-bd82-4adf-a1f0-14e04608ba5a\', \'multiverseId\': 385717}, \'multiverseid\': 385717}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你想作的并不犯法。不过，实在是极端愚蠢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5c1544-8265-4872-8a43-0cae051eda1a\', \'multiverseId\': 383445}, \'multiverseid\': 383445}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你想作的並不犯法。不過，實在是極端愚蠢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9d5dc9-9e56-43a9-8e77-aee70a7633e7\', \'multiverseId\': 383729}, \'multiverseid\': 383729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abfaulen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Allein dass es tödlich ist, würde schon reichen. Die Kunst aber besteht darin, das dadurch verursachte Leiden zu maximieren." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'effc51b0-3d8d-4a56-b6b4-79560efc259a\', \'multiverseId\': 384274}, \'multiverseid\': 384274}, {\'name\': \'Ulcerar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno. Pierdes 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si solo fuera mortal, sería suficiente. Sin embargo, el arte consiste en maximizar el sufrimiento que provoca". —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d17c7c07-8e4e-4268-8dee-8325c4866a47\', \'multiverseId\': 386262}, \'multiverseid\': 386262}, {\'name\': \'Ulcération\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous perdez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si elle était simplement mortelle, cela suffirait. Optimiser la souffrance qu\'elle cause, cependant, est un véritable art. » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90d0c8a5-bb1d-4ddd-93b2-e4131048f928\', \'multiverseId\': 384558}, \'multiverseid\': 384558}, {\'name\': \'Ulcerare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno. Perdi 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fosse semplicemente letale, sarebbe sufficiente. La vera arte, tuttavia, sta nel portare all\\\'estremo la sofferenza che provoca." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc75e863-278b-4932-b1ab-23d86d63023b\', \'multiverseId\': 384842}, \'multiverseid\': 384842}, {\'name\': \'潰瘍化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－３/－３の修整を受ける。あなたは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「単に致命的であるのなら、それだけで充分事足りるわ。それが与える苦しみを最大化する事こそが、美学なの。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3914d56-625e-40dd-8073-388b83f22d88\', \'multiverseId\': 385126}, \'multiverseid\': 385126}, {\'name\': \'궤양 발생\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-3을 받는다. 당신은 생명 3점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그냥 죽이기만 하면 별 볼 일 없지. 진짜 기술은 고통을 최대한 주는 데 있어." —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60878cc5-f8de-4f46-978e-35f96a314205\', \'multiverseId\': 385410}, \'multiverseid\': 385410}, {\'name\': \'Ulcerar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -3/-3 até o final do turno. Você perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fosse meramente letal, isso seria o suficiente. Porém, a arte consiste em maximizar o sofrimento causado." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4d5b6c-4a6f-43e7-9b4c-ca35c3da528e\', \'multiverseId\': 385694}, \'multiverseid\': 385694}, {\'name\': \'Изъязвление\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -3/-3 до конца хода. Вы теряете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Одной летальности, в принципе, было бы достаточно. Однако настоящее искусство заключается в причинении как можно больших страданий». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad6e085-8c1c-4469-a42c-6b7e217306d7\', \'multiverseId\': 385978}, \'multiverseid\': 385978}, {\'name\': \'溃烂\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。你失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果目的仅在于致命，这就够了。但这门技艺是要使它造成的痛苦达到最大。」 ～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3397bc8-497d-4dee-b0a6-28dcd8892970\', \'multiverseId\': 383706}, \'multiverseid\': 383706}, {\'name\': \'潰爛\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-3/-3直到回合結束。你失去3點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果目的僅在於致命，這就夠了。但這門技藝是要使它造成的痛苦達到最大。」 ～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd347a0-eb38-42d0-9356-783488757e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 383990}, \'multiverseid\': 383990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Wind soll die Luft beherrschen." —Dejara, Druide aus dem Güldenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384202&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'547d99e8-b586-41c9-8df2-e343c47fedbe\', \'multiverseId\': 384202}, \'multiverseid\': 384202}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que tenga la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no haya nada en los cielos, salvo el viento." —Dejara, druida de Madera Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a53810-4019-4cec-af8f-1e8bd8a59dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 386190}, \'multiverseid\': 386190}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul le vent doit contrôler les cieux. » —Dejara, druide de Boisdoré\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f745a84-b80b-4b6c-8fac-64cbc7d73864\', \'multiverseId\': 384486}, \'multiverseid\': 384486}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che nulla possieda i cieli se non il vento." —Dejara, druida di Boscodorato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1392352-449e-4f40-ab21-1d9ec1254280\', \'multiverseId\': 384770}, \'multiverseid\': 384770}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」 ――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65bf5cec-1c1f-4481-8fee-b69dcd7a01b7\', \'multiverseId\': 385054}, \'multiverseid\': 385054}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"바람 외에는 그 무엇도 하늘을 날지 못하게 하라." —금박숲 드루이드 데자라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c58561-75d4-4d7d-bf83-999657b0b0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 385338}, \'multiverseid\': 385338}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não deixe que nada além do vento domine o céu." — Dejara, druida de Bosque Dourado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1f0034b-31f2-4bfc-8071-d5b7dab3c17a\', \'multiverseId\': 385622}, \'multiverseid\': 385622}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть ничто не владеет небесами, кроме ветра». — Дежара, друид Золоченого Леса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff3574a-f68a-49e3-81df-0520f79dd743\', \'multiverseId\': 385906}, \'multiverseid\': 385906}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「风该是天空唯一的主人。」 ～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2afb3e43-ba30-4f22-9f23-5b6987ec8614\', \'multiverseId\': 383634}, \'multiverseid\': 383634}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「風該是天空唯一的主人。」 ～金林德魯伊笛賈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0597cafc-325b-448f-8270-cdc621ff4e23\', \'multiverseId\': 383918}, \'multiverseid\': 383918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Standhafte\', \'text\': \'+1: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1, Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit und Lebensverknüpfung.\\n-2: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, und eine Loyalitätsmarke auf jeden anderen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst.\\n-7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Falls eine Quelle dir oder einem Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, Schaden zufügen würde, verhindere alle bis auf 1 dieser Schadenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5bf98c-dc3f-4f88-8a43-095e6783ea48\', \'multiverseId\': 384032}, \'multiverseid\': 384032}, {\'name\': \'Ajani tenaz\', \'text\': \'+1: Hasta el final del turno, hasta una criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana las habilidades de dañar primero, vigilancia y vínculo vital.\\n-2: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y un contador de lealtad sobre cada uno de los otros planeswalkers que controlas.\\n-7: Obtienes un emblema con "Si una fuente fuera a hacerte daño a ti a o a un planeswalker que controlas, prevén todo excepto 1 punto de ese daño".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6edbfd9-4ea5-48a9-a9d4-a3dc6c0cd9fb\', \'multiverseId\': 386020}, \'multiverseid\': 386020}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'inébranlable", \'text\': "+1 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, jusqu\'à une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert l\'initiative, la vigilance et le lien de vie.\\n−2 : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et un marqueur « loyauté » sur chaque autre planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\\n−7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Si une source devait infliger des blessures à vous ou à un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, prévenez toutes ces blessures sauf 1. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384316&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1724a9db-d5d8-42cb-877d-3ac5d61553fd\', \'multiverseId\': 384316}, \'multiverseid\': 384316}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'Incrollabile", \'text\': \'+1: Fino alla fine del turno, fino a una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha attacco improvviso, cautela e legame vitale.\\n-2: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e un segnalino fedeltà su ogni altro planeswalker che controlli.\\n-7: Ottieni un emblema con "Se una fonte sta per infliggere danno a te o a un planeswalker che controlli, previeni tutto il danno tranne 1".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a04322-34e9-4286-ab85-3f861143bacb\', \'multiverseId\': 384600}, \'multiverseid\': 384600}, {\'name\': \'不動のアジャニ\', \'text\': \'＋１：クリーチャーを最大１体まで対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃と警戒と絆魂を得る。\\n－２：あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個、あなたがコントロールする他の各プレインズウォーカーの上に忠誠カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\n－７：あなたは「発生源があなたかあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーにダメージを与えるなら、そのダメージを１点を残してすべて軽減する。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46ac58f-851b-4e30-b606-8a626f65391d\', \'multiverseId\': 384884}, \'multiverseid\': 384884}, {\'name\': \'꿋꿋한 아자니\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 선제공격과 경계, 생명연결을 얻는다.\\n-2: 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 당신이 조종하는 다른 모든 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n-7: 당신은 "어느 원천이 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커에게 피해를 입히려 한다면, 그 피해 중 1점을 제외한 모든 피해를 방지한다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f08a737-0dfb-44c4-9c46-f04913f79cec\', \'multiverseId\': 385168}, \'multiverseid\': 385168}, {\'name\': \'Ajani Resoluto\', \'text\': \'+1: Até o final do turno, até uma criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha iniciativa, vigilância e vínculo com a vida.\\n-2: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e um marcador de lealdade em cada outro planeswalker que você controla.\\n-7: Você recebe um emblema com "Se uma fonte for causar dano a você ou a um planeswalker que você controla, previna todo o dano menos 1 ponto."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c1dd57-86cc-4ae1-ad61-ce4b18027188\', \'multiverseId\': 385452}, \'multiverseid\': 385452}, {\'name\': \'Аджани Непреклонный\', \'text\': \'+1: до конца хода не более чем одно целевое существо получает +1/+1 и Первый удар, Бдительность и Цепь жизни.\\n−2: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и один жетон верности на каждого другого planeswalker-а под вашим контролем.\\n−7: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Если источник должен нанести повреждения вам или planeswalker-у под вашим контролем, предотвратите все те повреждения, кроме 1».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791815bd-7324-4951-8f20-de9d71eb9b37\', \'multiverseId\': 385736}, \'multiverseid\': 385736}, {\'name\': \'坚定的阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：直到回合结束，至多一个目标生物得+1/+1且获得先攻，警戒与系命异能。\\n−2：在由你操控的每个生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物，并在每个由你操控的其他鹏洛客上各放置一个忠诚指示物。\\n−7：你获得具有「如果某来源将对你或由你操控的鹏洛客造成伤害，则防止其中除了1点以外的所有伤害」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc31b477-1042-49c1-a506-4ee720055f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 383464}, \'multiverseid\': 383464}, {\'name\': \'堅定的阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：直到回合結束，至多一個目標生物得+1/+1且獲得先攻，警戒與繫命異能。\\n−2：在由你操控的每個生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物，並在每個由你操控的其他鵬洛客上各放置一個忠誠指示物。\\n−7：你獲得具有「如果某來源將對你或由你操控的鵬洛客造成傷害，則防止其中除了1點以外的所有傷害」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12f6d5e-62d4-4e68-959d-3b8254b71546\', \'multiverseId\': 383748}, \'multiverseid\': 383748}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Rudelmitglied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Rudelmitglied legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn einer von uns Erfolg hat, gilt dies für das gesamte Rudel." —Jazal Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9393dc94-fd2d-4ccf-9131-d297d3991a53\', \'multiverseId\': 384033}, \'multiverseid\': 384033}, {\'name\': \'Compañero de manada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Compañero de manada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando uno de nosotros mejora, la manada mejora". —Jazal Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9286bfd-0758-40ad-8e58-1f6500c42005\', \'multiverseId\': 386021}, \'multiverseid\': 386021}, {\'name\': "Frère de bande d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Frère de bande d\'Ajani.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Quand l\'un de nous prospère, c\'est toute la bande qui prospère. » —Jazal Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384317&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80651be9-8472-4c23-9252-628abccf34ac\', \'multiverseId\': 384317}, \'multiverseid\': 384317}, {\'name\': \'Compagno di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Compagno di Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando uno di noi ha successo, l\\\'intero branco ha successo." —Jazal Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08d3de4-d604-42b6-84ca-347fe6a4acb9\', \'multiverseId\': 384601}, \'multiverseid\': 384601}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの群れ仲間\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたはアジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らのうちいずれかが繁栄する時、群れも繁栄する。」 ――黄金のたてがみのジャザル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a202fe-4543-49c4-95e6-f6a66e9ac44f\', \'multiverseId\': 384885}, \'multiverseid\': 384885}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 형제\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 당신은 아자니의 형제에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"하나의 번영이 곧 동족의 번영이다." —자잘 골드메인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9eb7ff5-8d37-4fa5-bf7f-c3289596583e\', \'multiverseId\': 385169}, \'multiverseid\': 385169}, {\'name\': \'Companheiro de Bando de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Companheiro de Bando de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando um de nós prospera, o bando prospera." — Jazal Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e331694-c111-4a41-ba43-08f5c8d72528\', \'multiverseId\': 385453}, \'multiverseid\': 385453}, {\'name\': \'Соплеменник Аджани\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Соплеменника Аджани.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда один из нас процветает, процветает весь прайд». — Златогривый Джазаль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72ef74d-2b3d-4110-ac7d-1aee992bdfbc\', \'multiverseId\': 385737}, \'multiverseid\': 385737}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一个享福，整群都能享福。」 ～金鬃贾佐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62982b75-14d1-4957-b470-4cdd6fb61229\', \'multiverseId\': 383465}, \'multiverseid\': 383465}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，你可以在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一個享福，整群都能享福。」 ～金鬃賈佐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f8b1a6-ba5e-4fe7-abcd-ce07c97ecc75\', \'multiverseId\': 383749}, \'multiverseid\': 383749}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akkord des Rufes\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Jede Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, reduziert dessen Kosten um {1} oder um ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132ffa15-d8f9-4e2c-818b-abb4e68bea2a\', \'multiverseId\': 384061}, \'multiverseid\': 384061}, {\'name\': \'Acorde de llamada\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con coste de maná convertido de X o menos y ponla en el campo de batalla. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf6b4c3-acb1-4d74-bd99-f06fbd211f50\', \'multiverseId\': 386049}, \'multiverseid\': 386049}, {\'name\': "Corde d\'adjuration", \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09da7ffb-f68e-4a5b-9e59-7d706a541f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 384345}, \'multiverseid\': 384345}, {\'name\': \'Corda della Convocazione\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X e mettila sul campo di battaglia. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e38f00-8abf-4d05-99f0-2389b05c6fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 384629}, \'multiverseid\': 384629}, {\'name\': \'召喚の調べ\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下のクリーチャー・カードを１枚探し、それを戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c8fa1d-bd5a-46be-89ff-69e66609f202\', \'multiverseId\': 384913}, \'multiverseid\': 384913}, {\'name\': \'소환의 화음\', \'text\': \'집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동할 때 탭하는 생물 한 개당 이 주문의 비용은 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색인 마나 한 개만큼 줄어든다.)\\n당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 X 이하인 생물 카드 한 장을 찾아 전장에 놓는다. 그러고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9df9fa8-956f-4864-8eb1-2deebc33207a\', \'multiverseId\': 385197}, \'multiverseid\': 385197}, {\'name\': \'Acorde do Chamado\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de criatura com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a X e coloque-o no campo de batalha. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5873a3d-bb0e-45b1-b146-66de343b3e30\', \'multiverseId\': 385481}, \'multiverseid\': 385481}, {\'name\': \'Призывный Аккорд\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью Х или меньше и положите ее на поле битвы. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96783fe-a384-4bdc-b6c3-d0d871edc35c\', \'multiverseId\': 385765}, \'multiverseid\': 385765}, {\'name\': \'和声召集\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于或小于X的生物牌，并将之放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4e49c1-d035-45cc-8877-7f583970e54e\', \'multiverseId\': 383493}, \'multiverseid\': 383493}, {\'name\': \'和聲召集\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n從你的牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用等於或小於X的生物牌，並將之放進戰場。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7eb929d-986c-4072-89ca-e65dc238444f\', \'multiverseId\': 383777}, \'multiverseid\': 383777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alarmschlagen\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wie Blinzeln oder Atmen ist die Reaktion auf einen Alarm eine unwillkürliche Handlung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68403f0d-0ef2-4c23-b4b5-27e00baa1ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 384208}, \'multiverseid\': 384208}, {\'name\': \'Dar la alarma\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Al igual que el parpadeo o la respiración, responder a una alarma es un reflejo involuntario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06ae07f-b9d0-4e63-b950-be53ad061c79\', \'multiverseId\': 386196}, \'multiverseid\': 386196}, {\'name\': "Sonner l\'alerte", \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Tout comme cligner des yeux ou respirer, réagir à une alerte est un réflexe involontaire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66981a5-daae-4f74-b910-27126a7fae8b\', \'multiverseId\': 384492}, \'multiverseid\': 384492}, {\'name\': "Dare l\'Allarme", \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Reagire a un allarme è un riflesso involontario, come sbattere le palpebre o respirare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d91f8ae6-21cb-48c8-9c2b-35c10c141e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 384776}, \'multiverseid\': 384776}, {\'name\': \'急報\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'瞬きや息をするのと同じように、急報に反応することは不随意の反射である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48bb99d-4f84-4a25-9e18-588be2201a18\', \'multiverseId\': 385060}, \'multiverseid\': 385060}, {\'name\': \'경보 발동\', \'text\': \'1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'경보에 반응하는 건 눈을 깜박이거나 숨을 쉬는 것과 같은 본능적인 반사 작용이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b93207c-a3d4-4579-bdf9-cb564a230ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 385344}, \'multiverseid\': 385344}, {\'name\': \'Soar o Alarme\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura brancas 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Assim como piscar e respirar, responder a um alarme é um reflexo involuntário.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e5f76a-a3be-43b0-9691-fa3d1bf0581d\', \'multiverseId\': 385628}, \'multiverseid\': 385628}, {\'name\': \'Поднять Тревогу\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 белый Солдат.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Подняться по тревоге для них — непроизвольная реакция, как моргание или дыхание.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37de4574-58bf-472b-8ddd-ad6bb23a4ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 385912}, \'multiverseid\': 385912}, {\'name\': \'扬起警报\', \'text\': \'将两个1/1白色士兵衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'响应警报就如眨眼和呼吸一样，是一种下意识的反应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c9403e-1ddd-4469-8b56-6f0d5a1a9d94\', \'multiverseId\': 383640}, \'multiverseid\': 383640}, {\'name\': \'揚起警報\', \'text\': \'將兩個1/1白色士兵衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'回應警報就如眨眼和呼吸一樣，是一種下意識的反應。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54896699-8bc5-4b98-bfdc-88723af38bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 383924}, \'multiverseid\': 383924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altac-Blutsucherin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, erhält die Altac-Blutsucherin +2/+0, Erstschlag und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu, und sie kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594324b8-4112-4e7f-bb1d-c8b61e8181ae\', \'multiverseId\': 384034}, \'multiverseid\': 384034}, {\'name\': \'Buscasangre de Altac\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, el Buscasangre de Altac obtiene +2/+0 y gana las habilidades de dañar primero y prisa hasta el final del turno. (Hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero y puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d82b2ef3-5c2c-4261-85b9-ff7f86fc0e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 386022}, \'multiverseid\': 386022}, {\'name\': "Cherchesang d\'Altac", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, la Cherchesang d\'Altac gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative, et peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384318&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d54a51-bb31-45fe-aa87-3ca7ad859680\', \'multiverseId\': 384318}, \'multiverseid\': 384318}, {\'name\': \'Cercasangue di Altac\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, la Cercasangue di Altac prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso e rapidità fino alla fine del turno. (Infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso e può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bfa274-5929-4073-8a20-afd7f6013b35\', \'multiverseId\': 384602}, \'multiverseid\': 384602}, {\'name\': \'アルタクの求血者\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、アルタクの求血者はターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃と速攻を得る。（これは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与え、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a984ab3e-fc0d-40ba-b8e8-fcc95a833078\', \'multiverseId\': 384886}, \'multiverseid\': 384886}, {\'name\': \'알탁 피추적자\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 알탁 피추적자는 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 선제공격과 신속을 얻는다. (이 생물은 선제공격이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입히며, 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 광전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df3d913-ec2e-47b6-affa-2c8d4617c528\', \'multiverseId\': 385170}, \'multiverseid\': 385170}, {\'name\': \'Caçador de Sangue de Altac\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morre, Caçador de Sangue de Altac recebe +2/+0 e ganha iniciativa e ímpeto até o final do turno. (Ele causa dano de combate antes de criaturas sem iniciativa e pode atacar e {T} assim que passa ao seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Amoque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a157cdfc-0ead-4e11-a214-9041f77dde12\', \'multiverseId\': 385454}, \'multiverseid\': 385454}, {\'name\': \'Альтакская Искательница Крови\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под контролем оппонента умирает, Альтакская Искательница Крови получает +2/+0, Первый удар и Ускорение до конца хода. (Она наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара и может атаковать и {T}, как только попадает под ваш контроль.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Берсерк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'026abc58-60d5-4a8b-bf87-8c34054bd996\', \'multiverseId\': 385738}, \'multiverseid\': 385738}, {\'name\': \'奥塔克觅血人\', \'text\': \'每当任一由对手操控的生物死去时，直到回合结束，奥塔克觅血人得+2/+0且获得先攻与敏捷异能。（它会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害，而且它受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狂战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7494031-29ce-40d3-979b-33b4dc704174\', \'multiverseId\': 383466}, \'multiverseid\': 383466}, {\'name\': \'奧塔克覓血人\', \'text\': \'每當任一由對手操控的生物死去時，直到回合結束，奧塔克覓血人得+2/+0且獲得先攻與敏捷異能。（它會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害，且它受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75c8f6a5-46f2-4d01-9f4a-9b4b9d2ec02e\', \'multiverseId\': 383750}, \'multiverseid\': 383750}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Silberrücken\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regeneriere den Alten Silberrücken. (Das nächste Mal, dass diese Kreatur in diesem Zug zerstört würde, wird sie nicht zerstört. Tappe sie stattdessen, entferne allen Schaden von ihr und entferne sie aus dem Kampf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73008bab-1008-4a38-92bf-adf840fde59b\', \'multiverseId\': 384036}, \'multiverseid\': 384036}, {\'name\': \'Lomo plateado antiguo\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regenera el Lomo plateado antiguo. (La próxima vez que esta criatura fuera a ser destruida este turno, no lo es. En vez de eso, gírala, remueve todo el daño de ella y remuévela del combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Simio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8992bb31-5af8-47de-b528-adce276d51ae\', \'multiverseId\': 386024}, \'multiverseid\': 386024}, {\'name\': \'Vieux gorille à dos argenté\', \'text\': "{G} : Régénérez le Vieux gorille à dos argenté. (La prochaine fois que cette créature devrait être détruite ce tour-ci, elle ne l\'est pas. À la place, engagez-la, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et retirez-la du combat.)", \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238bd055-20bb-4a65-88cb-6db9e3ccaee7\', \'multiverseId\': 384320}, \'multiverseid\': 384320}, {\'name\': \'Antico Schienargento\', \'text\': "{G}: Rigenera l\'Antico Schienargento. (La prossima volta che questa creatura sta per essere distrutta in questo turno, non viene distrutta. Invece TAPpala, rimuovi da essa tutto il danno e rimuovila dal combattimento.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4bbb6b5-9096-43fc-8bdb-c2c043b92093\', \'multiverseId\': 384604}, \'multiverseid\': 384604}, {\'name\': \'年経たシルバーバック\', \'text\': \'{G}：年経たシルバーバックを再生する。（このターン、次にこのクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、破壊されない。代わりに、これをタップし、これの負っているダメージをすべて取り除き、これを戦闘から取り除く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4014a855-b4a0-4b79-a882-46cd0b4deff4\', \'multiverseId\': 384888}, \'multiverseid\': 384888}, {\'name\': \'고대의 은등짝 고릴라\', \'text\': \'{G}: 고대의 은등짝 고릴라를 재생한다. (이번 턴에 다음으로 이 생물이 파괴되어야 할 경우에 이 생물은 파괴되지 않는다. 대신 이 생물을 탭하고 전투에서 제거하며, 이 생물로부터 모든 피해를 제거한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 유인원\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5aec2de-f734-4000-816a-739728a2155d\', \'multiverseId\': 385172}, \'multiverseid\': 385172}, {\'name\': \'Gorila Ancião de Dorso Prateado\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regenere Gorila Ancião de Dorso Prateado. (Na próxima vez em que esta criatura seria destruída neste turno, ela não será. Em vez disso, vire-a, remova todo o dano dela e remova-a do combate.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Símio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a6ba00-ffa0-43fb-abff-3a8f1e706e56\', \'multiverseId\': 385456}, \'multiverseid\': 385456}, {\'name\': \'Старый Вожак Горилл\', \'text\': \'{G}: регенерируйте Старого Вожака Горилл. (В следующий раз при уничтожении этого существа в этом ходу, оно не уничтожается. Вместо этого поверните его, снимите с него все повреждения и удалите его из боя.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Обезьяна\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934c3c34-153f-4dfc-8c66-f87d5cf76675\', \'multiverseId\': 385740}, \'multiverseid\': 385740}, {\'name\': \'老银背\', \'text\': \'{G}：重生老银背。（如果此生物下一次于本回合中将被消灭，则它不会被消灭，而是改为将它横置，移除受过的所有伤害，并将它移出战斗。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猿猴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46596e2-abcd-4bc0-a2f7-e25c3956254c\', \'multiverseId\': 383468}, \'multiverseid\': 383468}, {\'name\': \'老銀背\', \'text\': \'{G}：重生老銀背。（如果此生物下一次於本回合中將被消滅，則它不會被消滅，而是改為將它橫置，移除受過的所有傷害，並將它移出戰鬥。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猿猴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b52e08d2-05dc-4a19-a8c5-3bb95c5381e1\', \'multiverseId\': 383752}, \'multiverseid\': 383752}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amphin-Wegbereiter\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Salamander, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche glauben nicht an die Existenz der Amphin. Offenbar deswegen, weil sie selbst es so wollen." —Gor Muldrak, Geheime Historien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efece202-3c96-4648-8ed3-897f652be2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 384035}, \'multiverseid\': 384035}, {\'name\': \'Mago alternativo anfino\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero salamandra\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay quienes no creen en la existencia de los anfinos. De algún modo, parece que es así por sus propios designios". —Gor Muldrak, Criptohistorias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8b0c66e-af9d-4647-8edf-1b8d4dbcdad8\', \'multiverseId\': 386023}, \'multiverseid\': 386023}, {\'name\': \'Sentemage amphin\', \'text\': \'{2}{U} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : salamandre et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Certains refusent de croire à l\'existence des amphins. Cela semble s\'apparenter à de l\'aveuglement volontaire. » —Gor Muldrak, Cryptohistoires", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384319&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfc4398-9375-43da-92c8-288f23892304\', \'multiverseId\': 384319}, \'multiverseid\': 384319}, {\'name\': \'Mago dei Sentieri Amphin\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Salamandra\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni non credono nell\\\'esistenza degli amphin. Tale idea sembra essere stata diffusa di proposito dagli amphin stessi." —Gor Muldrak, Criptostorie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee7a390-a844-4cb5-bbc2-f9256daf1d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 384603}, \'multiverseid\': 384603}, {\'name\': \'アンフィンの抜け道魔道士\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サラマンダー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「なかには、アンフィンの存在を信じない者もいる。これは彼らがあえてそう仕向けているようでもある。」 ――ゴー・ムルドラク「秘史」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2c8089-a6f0-4bcc-b31a-1270d0cb00a4\', \'multiverseId\': 384887}, \'multiverseid\': 384887}, {\'name\': \'앰핀 통로술사\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 샐러맨더 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"앰핀의 존재를 믿지 않는 이들이 있다. 어떻게 보면 그 자신들이 이를 원하는 듯 하다." —비밀역사 고르 멀드락\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dbee8cc-2551-4f15-840f-c79dc8d214ab\', \'multiverseId\': 385171}, \'multiverseid\': 385171}, {\'name\': \'Mago Trilhador Amphin\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Salamandra Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Há aqueles que não acreditam na existência dos amphin. Isso parece ser exatamente o que eles querem." — Gor Muldrak, Criptohistórias\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb87a68-6e38-43a2-810c-88e7240d068a\', \'multiverseId\': 385455}, \'multiverseid\': 385455}, {\'name\': \'Амфин-Проводник\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Саламандра Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть и такие, кто не верит в существование амфинов. Видимо, сами амфины каким-то образом это устроили». — Гор Мулдрак, Криптоистории\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7945b1-8ef5-4d9e-bacc-e60391f229c6\', \'multiverseId\': 385739}, \'multiverseid\': 385739}, {\'name\': \'埃分径法师\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～火蜥蜴／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「仍有部分人不相信埃分一族确实存在。这恐怕只是他们的一厢情愿。」 ～葛末札，《寰海探秘》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab709bb8-c349-42f5-ade2-58acd100a178\', \'multiverseId\': 383467}, \'multiverseid\': 383467}, {\'name\': \'埃分徑法師\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～火蜥蜴／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「仍有部分人不相信埃分一族確實存在。這恐怕只是他們的一廂情願。」 ～葛末札，《寰海探秘》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b7d03d-e247-480a-8077-0acfe72b46ad\', \'multiverseId\': 383751}, \'multiverseid\': 383751}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett der Habgier\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und hat Wachsamkeit und „Ziehe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Karte."\\nWenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, übernimmt ein Gegner deiner Wahl die Kontrolle über das Amulett der Habgier.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Nach einer Idee von Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba3ed89-ad6f-46fb-b6e6-b4f8ebbb910c\', \'multiverseId\': 384038}, \'multiverseid\': 384038}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de avaricia\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0, tiene la habilidad de vigilancia y "Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, roba una carta".\\nCuando la criatura equipada muera, el oponente objetivo gana el control del Amuleto de avaricia.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Diseñada por Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acc2f24c-e399-4b39-a465-6ae743e659bf\', \'multiverseId\': 386026}, \'multiverseid\': 386026}, {\'name\': "Amulette d\'avarice", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et a la vigilance et « Au début de votre entretien, piochez une carte. »\\nQuand la créature équipée meurt, l\'adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Amulette d\'avarice.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Conçue par Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db11a7b2-34e1-4658-99dc-315b04e4db8c\', \'multiverseId\': 384322}, \'multiverseid\': 384322}, {\'name\': "Amuleto dell\'Avarizia", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 e ha cautela e "All\\\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, pesca una carta".\\nQuando la creatura equipaggiata muore, un avversario bersaglio prende il controllo dell\\\'Amuleto dell\\\'Avarizia.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ideata da Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'622a834f-4e79-4022-b87a-b520170e2afe\', \'multiverseId\': 384606}, \'multiverseid\': 384606}, {\'name\': \'強欲の護符\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに警戒と「あなたのアップキープの開始時に、カードを１枚引く。」を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは強欲の護符のコントロールを得る。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'デザイン：Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599ea5e9-def8-487c-9044-dab44dfdb812\', \'multiverseId\': 384890}, \'multiverseid\': 384890}, {\'name\': \'탐욕의 부적\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받으며 경계와 "당신의 유지단 시작에, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 가진다.\\n장착된 생물이 죽을 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 탐욕의 부적의 조종권을 얻는다.\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'디자인: Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b85991-8fef-411c-bd07-2f464697dd74\', \'multiverseId\': 385174}, \'multiverseid\': 385174}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto da Avareza\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0 e tem vigilância e "No início de sua manutenção, compre um card."\\nQuando a criatura equipada morre, o oponente alvo ganha o controle de Amuleto da Avareza.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe-o à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Criado por Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd88785-6a05-4af3-9e6c-5c1a12cacd99\', \'multiverseId\': 385458}, \'multiverseid\': 385458}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Алчности\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0, имеет Бдительность и способность «В начале вашего шага поддержки возьмите карту».\\nКогда снаряженное существо умирает, целевой оппонент получает контроль над Амулетом Алчности.\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Авторы карты: Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c30f66-25e6-43d8-9552-4ec7542918ea\', \'multiverseId\': 385742}, \'multiverseid\': 385742}, {\'name\': \'贪欲护身符\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有警戒异能与「在你的维持开始时，抓一张牌。」\\n当佩带此武具的生物死去时，目标对手获得贪欲护身符的操控权。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'设计者：Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73b8499-49d0-40a3-9669-7c4ea5f179f1\', \'multiverseId\': 383470}, \'multiverseid\': 383470}, {\'name\': \'貪欲護身符\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有警戒異能與「在你的維持開始時，抽一張牌。」\\n當佩帶此武具的生物死去時，目標對手獲得貪欲護身符的操控權。\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：裝備在由你操控的目標生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'設計者：Penny Arcade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e5b143-0ffa-4771-945a-30209fd896ce\', \'multiverseId\': 383754}, \'multiverseid\': 383754}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiger Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Remasuris wurden geschickt darin, bei anderen Spezies eine Angstreaktion auszulösen." —Hastric, Thune-Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7009ef6e-53ea-4a5f-81bb-7e566a7b7e81\', \'multiverseId\': 384042}, \'multiverseid\': 384042}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado beligerante\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"Los fragmentados se convirtieron en expertos en provocar una respuesta de terror en otras especies". —Hastric, explorador de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0ac9e15-a34c-4061-81cd-67c04b52a49e\', \'multiverseId\': 386030}, \'multiverseid\': 386030}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde belligérant\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Les slivoïdes finirent par évoquer un sentiment de peur aux autres espèces. » —Hastric, éclaireur thiunien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384326&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee46312-a540-41d0-b150-72d4b0e6a298\', \'multiverseId\': 384326}, \'multiverseid\': 384326}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Bellicoso\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"I tramutanti divennero esperti nell\\\'attivare i meccanismi di paura delle altre specie." —Hastric, esploratore di Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c644adb-a0e9-4ec1-ba1b-61635b75d5c6\', \'multiverseId\': 384610}, \'multiverseid\': 384610}, {\'name\': \'好戦スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「スリヴァーは他の種族に恐怖による反応を引き出すのに長けるようになってきた。」 ――テューンの斥候、ハストリック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47cdf2be-9afc-4c45-a752-b5bc5e2b158a\', \'multiverseId\': 384894}, \'multiverseid\': 384894}, {\'name\': \'적대적인 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'"슬리버들은 환경에 적응해 다른 종에게 공포심을 불러일으킨다." —쑨의 정찰병 하스트릭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf4fe01-ea1b-4d53-b6f9-0d8f386c3a49\', \'multiverseId\': 385178}, \'multiverseid\': 385178}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Beligerante\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Os fractius tornaram-se especialistas em provocar medo nas outras espécies." — Hastric, batedor thuniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396753bd-a529-4ceb-a0ef-07950c8238f3\', \'multiverseId\': 385462}, \'multiverseid\': 385462}, {\'name\': \'Воинственная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Щепки хорошо научились вызывать страх у других созданий». — Хастрик, тунский разведчик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0afcc3db-bce8-4c65-9fbe-a3e702aebebd\', \'multiverseId\': 385746}, \'multiverseid\': 385746}, {\'name\': \'好斗裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。」\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「裂片妖越来越擅长激起其他种族心中的恐惧。」 ～图恩斥候海司齐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f103a34-c214-464c-8235-11e953235119\', \'multiverseId\': 383474}, \'multiverseid\': 383474}, {\'name\': \'好鬥裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。」\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「裂片妖越來越擅長激起其他種族心中的恐懼。」 ～圖恩斥候海司齊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ec2453-1cb3-4778-8ffd-5f107122601b\', \'multiverseId\': 383758}, \'multiverseid\': 383758}]', "[{'name': 'Anmutiger Pegasus', 'text': 'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)\\nLebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pegasus', 'flavor': 'Den heiligen Federn des Pegasus werden heilende Kräfte nachgesagt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384259&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f370ea1-ea92-4927-9503-29bb5543b5c5', 'multiverseId': 384259}, 'multiverseid': 384259}, {'name': 'Pegaso gracia solar', 'text': 'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)\\nVínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Pegaso', 'flavor': 'Se dice que las plumas sagradas de los pegasos tienen poderes curativos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386247&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c5be6d5-9be3-40e9-a48b-59995bf56c8d', 'multiverseId': 386247}, 'multiverseid': 386247}, {'name': 'Pégase solgrâce', 'text': 'Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)\\nLien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)', 'type': 'Créature : pégase', 'flavor': 'On prête des vertus curatives aux plumes sacrées des pégases.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384543&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8cbbe62-619d-4359-b72f-fbbeabc15489', 'multiverseId': 384543}, 'multiverseid': 384543}, {'name': 'Pegaso dalla Grazia Solare', 'text': 'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)\\nLegame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Pegaso', 'flavor': 'Si narra che le sacre piume del pegaso abbiano poteri curativi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384827&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c02295f9-77c8-4746-b63a-b57850a55d26', 'multiverseId': 384827}, 'multiverseid': 384827}, {'name': '天麗のペガサス', 'text': '飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ペガサス', 'flavor': 'ペガサスの聖なる羽には、治癒の力があると言われている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385111&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf69dc50-a005-4f1b-a530-5ea59ee32d79', 'multiverseId': 385111}, 'multiverseid': 385111}, {'name': '빛나는 페가수스', 'text': '비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 당신은 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)', 'type': '생물 — 페가수스', 'flavor': '페가수스의 신성한 깃털은 치유력을 지녔다고 한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385395&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4552b81b-cd30-4087-b736-37113f4970c3', 'multiverseId': 385395}, 'multiverseid': 385395}, {'name': 'Pégaso da Graça Solar', 'text': 'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)\\nVínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Pégaso', 'flavor': 'Diz-se que as penas sagradas do pégaso têm poderes curativos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385679&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07006e1d-57d1-47a5-9ded-3045272f8c9d', 'multiverseId': 385679}, 'multiverseid': 385679}, {'name': 'Пегас Солнечного Изящества', 'text': 'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)\\nЦепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)', 'type': 'Существо — Пегас', 'flavor': 'Говорят, что священные перья пегаса обладают целительной силой.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385963&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a3d81bf-84a9-43eb-9d2a-5106cb9e1388', 'multiverseId': 385963}, 'multiverseid': 385963}, {'name': '日华飞马', 'text': '飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）\\n系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）', 'type': '生物～飞马', 'flavor': '飞马神圣的羽毛据说能够疗伤。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383691&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48b0ab75-af3c-498a-a3af-b0a3af87fff9', 'multiverseId': 383691}, 'multiverseid': 383691}, {'name': '日華飛馬', 'text': '飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）\\n繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）', 'type': '生物～飛馬', 'flavor': '飛馬神聖的羽毛據說能夠療傷。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383975&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1bffaad-0f6e-44f2-a7fc-37b3b2510905', 'multiverseId': 383975}, 'multiverseid': 383975}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anstürmendes Nashorn\', \'text\': \'Das Anstürmende Nashorn kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ritter der Troinir-Feste wählten das Nashorn als ihr Emblem aufgrund seiner Beharrlichkeit beim Ansturm auf Bedrohungen — eine Charaktereigenschaft, die sie bei einem Jagdausflug entdeckten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384057&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e92252-0480-4587-8e67-e458637fbce6\', \'multiverseId\': 384057}, \'multiverseid\': 384057}, {\'name\': \'Rinoceronte en carga\', \'text\': \'El Rinoceronte en carga no puede ser bloqueado por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Los caballeros de la Fortaleza Troinir tomaron al rinoceronte como emblema por su intensa concentración al cargar contra una supuesta amenaza; un rasgo que descubrieron en una excursión de caza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e170ff-2187-4a41-ad10-d075721f921d\', \'multiverseId\': 386045}, \'multiverseid\': 386045}, {\'name\': \'Rhinocéros fougueux\', \'text\': "Le Rhinocéros fougueux ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros\', \'flavor\': "Les chevaliers de Castel Troinir choisirent le rhinocéros pour emblème après avoir chassé l\'animal — et constaté qu\'il chargeait inlassablement la même menace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'947277e8-326b-4716-9891-b6429abc9a63\', \'multiverseId\': 384341}, \'multiverseid\': 384341}, {\'name\': \'Rinoceronte alla Carica\', \'text\': \'Il Rinoceronte alla Carica non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'I cavalieri della Roccaforte di Troinir scelsero il rinoceronte come proprio emblema per la sua intensa concentrazione mentre carica ciò che percepisce come una minaccia; caratteristica, questa, che scoprirono durante una battuta di caccia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90118f59-e3bb-4a14-92cb-543d62d949e5\', \'multiverseId\': 384625}, \'multiverseid\': 384625}, {\'name\': \'突進するサイ\', \'text\': \'突進するサイは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ\', \'flavor\': \'敵と認識した対象に向かって突撃する時に発揮する強い集中力にあやかろうと、トロイニア砦の騎士団はサイをその紋章に採用した。彼らはその特性を狩猟遠征中に発見した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fdafffa-271c-4dc1-ba6f-372e6e0a98cb\', \'multiverseId\': 384909}, \'multiverseid\': 384909}, {\'name\': \'돌진하는 코뿔소\', \'text\': \'돌진하는 코뿔소는 한 개의 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코뿔소\', \'flavor\': \'사냥여행 도중, 인지된 위협 대상에게 돌진하는 코뿔소의 특성을 알게 된 트로이니르 성의 기사들은 코뿔소가 돌진할 때 보이는 강렬한 집중력에 감탄하여 자신들의 휘장에 코뿔소를 담았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380dd402-1263-4309-aef6-c5850ee21f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 385193}, \'multiverseid\': 385193}, {\'name\': \'Rinoceronte Atacante\', \'text\': \'Rinoceronte Atacante não pode ser bloqueado por mais do que uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Os cavaleiros do Forte de Tronir escolheram o rinoceronte como símbolo por sua concentração absoluta ao atacar um perigo iminente, uma característica descoberta em uma excursão de caça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa27e3f-acd6-44ef-9752-2c90ba320181\', \'multiverseId\': 385477}, \'multiverseid\': 385477}, {\'name\': \'Атакующий Носорог\', \'text\': \'Атакующий Носорог не может быть заблокирован более чем одним существом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Носорог\', \'flavor\': \'Рыцари крепости Тройнир сделали своим символом носорога за ту яростную сосредоточенность, с которой он бросается на угрозу. Они на себе испытали свирепость этого зверя, столкнувшись с ним на охоте.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3395b50-f5b8-4c76-8f24-23c78d44f590\', \'multiverseId\': 385761}, \'multiverseid\': 385761}, {\'name\': \'冲锋犀牛\', \'text\': \'冲锋犀牛不能被一个以上的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～犀牛\', \'flavor\': \'崔尼尔要塞的骑士把犀牛当作标志，因为犀牛察觉到威胁便会向其全力冲刺～这是他们某次狩猎旅程的发现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfb1731-93d7-4569-882b-fdd4ff7ca8b0\', \'multiverseId\': 383489}, \'multiverseid\': 383489}, {\'name\': \'衝鋒犀牛\', \'text\': \'衝鋒犀牛不能被一個以上的生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～犀牛\', \'flavor\': \'崔尼爾要塞的騎士把犀牛當作標誌，因為犀牛察覺到威脅便會向其全力衝刺～這是他們某次狩獵旅程的發現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5730073-deda-41d2-8f85-f3e6145cec6d\', \'multiverseId\': 383773}, \'multiverseid\': 383773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arglist des Waldläufers\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 und Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Wildnis überlebt man nicht, indem man sich für alle sichtbar mitten in die Landschaft stellt." —Garruk Wildsprecher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384209&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d78ed75-75bd-4194-a7e6-4613ce04d05b\', \'multiverseId\': 384209}, \'multiverseid\': 384209}, {\'name\': \'Astucia del guardabosque\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No sobrevives en estado salvaje quedándote parado a plena luz del día." —Garruk Portavoz Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a53fa1fb-adff-4872-85dc-027496ff3753\', \'multiverseId\': 386197}, \'multiverseid\': 386197}, {\'name\': \'Sagacité du ranger\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour survivre en pleine nature, mieux vaut se mettre à couvert. » —Garruk Languebestion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec25a47f-2a7e-456c-90d7-3335289415c1\', \'multiverseId\': 384493}, \'multiverseid\': 384493}, {\'name\': \'Astuzia del Ranger\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 e ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nelle terre selvagge non sopravviverai piazzandoti in bella vista." —Garruk Lingua Selvaggia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'457e1c3d-0881-42eb-ba94-27b76ec28309\', \'multiverseId\': 384777}, \'multiverseid\': 384777}, {\'name\': \'レインジャーの悪知恵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに呪禁を得る。（それは、対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自分の姿を晒していては、荒野で生き延びることはできない。」 ――野生語りのガラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745692a7-621c-4400-a82e-ba57c742a937\', \'multiverseId\': 385061}, \'multiverseid\': 385061}, {\'name\': \'레인저의 간계\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 방호를 얻는다. (해당 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자연 속에서 살아남기 위해서는 숨을 줄도 알아야 한다." —개럭 와일드스피커\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83cba21a-e198-4f54-be4c-56b2aa36328d\', \'multiverseId\': 385345}, \'multiverseid\': 385345}, {\'name\': \'Ardil do Patrulheiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 e ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ninguém sobrevive na natureza ficando parado à vista." — Garruk Falabravo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6f219a0-bb11-4d91-9789-ea289096f84a\', \'multiverseId\': 385629}, \'multiverseid\': 385629}, {\'name\': \'Хитрость Лесничего\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 и Порчеустойчивость до конца хода. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Хочешь выжить в лесу — не стой на виду». — Гаррук Дикоречивый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41e72754-569c-437f-8a2e-891b743d2041\', \'multiverseId\': 385913}, \'multiverseid\': 385913}, {\'name\': \'护林人的智谋\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得辟邪异能。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果丝毫不掩蔽行踪，你将无法在野地存活。」 ～召兽使贾路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6909ffe3-1b24-4712-92a1-1922628207cc\', \'multiverseId\': 383641}, \'multiverseid\': 383641}, {\'name\': \'護林人的智謀\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得辟邪異能。（它不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果絲毫不掩蔽行蹤，你將無法在野地存活。」 ～召獸使賈路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca1b3d4-6b4c-4c15-93e7-2a33091668e9\', \'multiverseId\': 383925}, \'multiverseid\': 383925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Artefaktbeseelung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt\\nDas verzauberte Artefakt ist zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Allzu oft denkt sich irgendein selbst ernanntes Genie eine „arbeitssparende Vorrichtung" aus, die am Ende nur noch mehr Arbeit macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2782a14a-1502-48df-a8be-348a14aa5519\', \'multiverseId\': 384084}, \'multiverseid\': 384084}, {\'name\': \'Artefacto animado\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto.\\nEl artefacto encantado es una criatura con fuerza y resistencia base 5/5 además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Con demasiada frecuencia, algún genio autoproclamado idea un "aparato para ahorrar esfuerzos" que acaba por generar mucho más trabajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca20833-8739-4d37-a03b-8418ee91534c\', \'multiverseId\': 386072}, \'multiverseid\': 386072}, {\'name\': "Infuser l\'âme aux artefacts", \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact\\nL\'artefact enchanté est une créature avec une force et une endurance de base de 5/5 en plus de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Bien souvent, les génies autoproclamés accouchent d\'une « machine travaillant à notre place » qui, en définitive, occasionne un surcroît de travail.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384368&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caf1a926-70b7-4569-9d5d-20f7f3405b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 384368}, \'multiverseid\': 384368}, {\'name\': \'Artefatto Vivificato\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto\\nL\'artefatto incantato è una creatura con forza e costituzione base 5/5 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Accade fin troppo spesso che un sedicente genio crei un "dispositivo di sostegno al lavoro" che finisce per richiedere il doppio dello sforzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c468e28f-d013-480b-91fa-9fee40665a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 384652}, \'multiverseid\': 384652}, {\'name\': \'アーティファクトの魂込め\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクト）\\nエンチャントされているアーティファクトは、他のタイプに加えて基本のパワーとタフネスが５/５のクリーチャーである。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'多くの場合、自称天才が考案したとされる「労力節約のための装置」というものは、さらに多くの仕事を作り出す結果をもたらすものである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92e992f6-fc8c-4d96-a53f-e19872a32cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 384936}, \'multiverseid\': 384936}, {\'name\': \'마법물체 영혼주입\', \'text\': \'마법물체에 부여\\n부여된 마법물체는 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 기본 공격력 및 방어력이 5/5인 생물이다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'너무나도 자주, 자신을 천재라 일컫는 이들이 "생력 장치"를 들고 나타나 결국엔 훨씬 많은 일을 초래하고 만다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349f6212-5342-4e6c-84f1-3fc51b8267df\', \'multiverseId\': 385220}, \'multiverseid\': 385220}, {\'name\': \'Vivificar Artefato\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato\\nO artefato encantado é uma criatura com 5/5 de poder e resistência básicos além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Tem sempre alguém que se diz gênio e cria algum "equipamento para poupar trabalho" que acaba gerando muito mais trabalho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564795da-59ee-49f0-88dc-87e4f177bbc0\', \'multiverseId\': 385504}, \'multiverseid\': 385504}, {\'name\': \'Одушевление Артефакта\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт\\nЗачарованный артефакт является существом с базовыми силой и выносливостью 5/5 в дополнение к своим другим типам.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Слишком уж часто какой-нибудь самозваный гений придумывает очередное «устройство для экономии сил», которое в результате лишь доставляет новые хлопоты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe24d02-4e1c-4c5d-9026-950c03a44e36\', \'multiverseId\': 385788}, \'multiverseid\': 385788}, {\'name\': \'神器缄灵\', \'text\': \'结附于神器\\n所结附的神器是基础力量与防御力为5/5的生物，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'某些自诩的奇才发明出的「省力装置」到头来往往只会让人更费力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98700956-c375-4b92-a5c2-567248ac7ada\', \'multiverseId\': 383516}, \'multiverseid\': 383516}, {\'name\': \'神器緘靈\', \'text\': \'結附於神器\\n所結附的神器是基礎力量與防禦力為5/5的生物，且仍具有原本類別。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'某些自詡的奇才發明出的「省力裝置」到頭來往往只會讓人更費力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d6c16d8-ae48-4823-b9fc-69208de43285\', \'multiverseId\': 383800}, \'multiverseid\': 383800}]', '[{\'name\': \'Assistent des Nekromagiers\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Assistent des Nekromagiers ins Spiel kommt, lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Zombies und Nekromagier sind sich einig: Ein leichter Zugang zum Gehirn ist am besten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384174&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4d5cc5-1b9c-423b-a3ff-eb09bfbafdbf\', \'multiverseId\': 384174}, \'multiverseid\': 384174}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante del nigromante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ayudante del nigromante entre al campo de batalla, pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los zombies y los nigromantes coinciden: es mucho mejor que haya un fácil acceso al cerebro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2154eb6-6705-42d6-9130-ac9e39065108\', \'multiverseId\': 386162}, \'multiverseid\': 386162}, {\'name\': \'Assistant du nécromancien\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Assistant du nécromancien arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Les zombies et les nécromanciens sont d\'accords : simplifier l\'accès au cerveau est toujours souhaitable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96ddc71-3bc6-42ea-9e6c-38e8aaff6166\', \'multiverseId\': 384458}, \'multiverseid\': 384458}, {\'name\': \'Assistente del Necromante\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assistente del Necromante entra nel campo di battaglia, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Gli zombie e i necromanti sono d\'accordo: è sempre meglio conservare i cervelli a portata di mano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5dfee39-6a63-414b-a86f-c84ab9107cda\', \'multiverseId\': 384742}, \'multiverseid\': 384742}, {\'name\': \'屍術士の助手\', \'text\': \'屍術士の助手が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'脳へ容易に触れられるのが良いことであるという点については、ゾンビと屍術士の両者は同意する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22635c8e-97c0-420e-ac9c-1cbffb29eb12\', \'multiverseId\': 385026}, \'multiverseid\': 385026}, {\'name\': \'사령술사의 조수\', \'text\': \'사령술사의 조수가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'좀비나 사령술사나 뇌를 꺼내기 쉬운 시체를 좋아한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16504a00-c262-48e9-bf00-f1e2ea5cfae1\', \'multiverseId\': 385310}, \'multiverseid\': 385310}, {\'name\': \'Assistente do Necromante\', \'text\': \'Quando Assistente do Necromante entrar no campo de batalha, coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Zumbis e necromantes concordam: acesso facilitado ao cérebro é preferível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69689173-c386-435e-bc1c-e565e107acb8\', \'multiverseId\': 385594}, \'multiverseid\': 385594}, {\'name\': \'Помощник Некроманта\', \'text\': \'Когда Помощник Некроманта выходит на поле битвы, положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Зомби и некроманты сходятся в том, что чем проще добраться до мозгов — тем лучше.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1072ca63-d375-4c05-9586-f7046dfda7f5\', \'multiverseId\': 385878}, \'multiverseid\': 385878}, {\'name\': \'死灵术士助手\', \'text\': \'当死灵术士助手进战场时，将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'灵俑和死灵术士都同意一点：脑子越方便下手越好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f0c800-9cd4-4200-a384-e46da4e561dc\', \'multiverseId\': 383606}, \'multiverseid\': 383606}, {\'name\': \'死靈術士助手\', \'text\': \'當死靈術士助手進戰場時，將你牌庫頂的三張牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'殭屍和死靈術士都同意一點：腦子越方便下手越好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebd5c93-7d81-4f86-9341-6e41b6070dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 383890}, \'multiverseid\': 383890}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Garruks Pfad\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die du nicht kontrollierst, und alle Planeswalker, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jenseits des Schmerzes, der Besessenheit und der wilden Verzweiflung existiert ein Ort perverser Macht, die nur die gequältesten Seelen erreichen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ad90dc-7706-4601-92ea-ddb0b24cb582\', \'multiverseId\': 384127}, \'multiverseid\': 384127}, {\'name\': \'Tras los pasos de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no controlas y todos los planeswalkers que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Más allá del dolor, más allá de la obsesión y de la desesperanza incontrolable, existe un lugar de retorcido poder que solo pueden alcanzar las almas más atormentadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2fdd33-ca4b-41cf-a1da-2dd7334385f4\', \'multiverseId\': 386115}, \'multiverseid\': 386115}, {\'name\': \'Dans le sillage de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures que vous ne contrôlez pas et tous les planeswalkers que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au-delà de la souffrance, de l\'obsession et du noir désespoir existe un lieu de corruption que seules les âmes les plus tourmentées peuvent atteindre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2cac4be-ef08-4b59-957f-75b7a6f4515b\', \'multiverseId\': 384411}, \'multiverseid\': 384411}, {\'name\': \'Sulla Scia di Garruk\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non controlli e tutti i planeswalker che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Oltre il dolore, oltre l\'ossessione e la pura disperazione, si trova un luogo dal potere corrotto che solo le anime più tormentate possono raggiungere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad579604-c66a-4cc2-97ea-c01dc74b7979\', \'multiverseId\': 384695}, \'multiverseid\': 384695}, {\'name\': \'ガラクの目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのクリーチャーと、あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのプレインズウォーカーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'苦痛や執着、そして激しい無念を超越したある場所に、極限まで苛まれた魂のみが到達することができる所があるという。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ef2bce-06d3-4b75-b1b0-d1b07471c93b\', \'multiverseId\': 384979}, \'multiverseid\': 384979}, {\'name\': \'개럭의 발자취\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하지 않는 모든 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 모든 플레인즈워커를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'고통과 강박, 절망을 넘어 오직 소수의 괴로운 영혼만이 도달할 수 있는 뒤틀린 장소가 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28851bb1-2921-4c58-9824-76e61c68af46\', \'multiverseId\': 385263}, \'multiverseid\': 385263}, {\'name\': \'No Rastro de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que você não controla e todos os planeswalker que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Além da dor, da obsessão e do desespero selvagem, há um lugar de poder distorcido que só as almas mais atormentadas conseguem alcançar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eefaa30-6ba6-45af-9b87-6cb29a95aad1\', \'multiverseId\': 385547}, \'multiverseid\': 385547}, {\'name\': \'Где Прошел Гаррук\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа не под вашим контролем и всех planeswalker-ов не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'За болью, одержимостью и бездной отчаяния есть место средоточия неописуемой силы, до которого могут добраться лишь самые измученные души.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d554edd-03f8-4563-ae98-04e1bb9c0d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 385831}, \'multiverseid\': 385831}, {\'name\': \'贾路开道\', \'text\': \'消灭所有不由你操控的生物和鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有一处超越痛苦，超越执着与绝望，充满扭曲力量的所在，只有遭受折磨最深的灵魂才能到达。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08edd93d-f0ae-4c5a-8f19-cd6b2b62a6c7\', \'multiverseId\': 383559}, \'multiverseid\': 383559}, {\'name\': \'賈路開道\', \'text\': \'消滅所有不由你操控的生物和鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'有一處超越痛苦，超越執著與絕望，充滿扭曲力量的所在，只有遭受折磨最深的靈魂才能到達。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a3c446-4450-46b7-8494-a0572d96a2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 383843}, \'multiverseid\': 383843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflösung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Scheußlichkeit gehörte nie in unsere Welt. Ich lasse sie nur frei." —Dierk, Geistermagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384078&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dca3d56-ad71-426e-b2b7-5ae7acd1da75\', \'multiverseId\': 384078}, \'multiverseid\': 384078}, {\'name\': \'Disipar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta abominación nunca perteneció a nuestro mundo. Simplemente estoy liberándola." —Dierk, mago de geists\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cacb122-3b70-4467-aec1-145b50ca2294\', \'multiverseId\': 386066}, \'multiverseid\': 386066}, {\'name\': \'Dissipation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Cette abomination n\'a jamais eu sa place sur notre monde. Je ne fais que la libérer. » —Dierk, geistmage", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6398a48-1906-4a7a-840a-abeeb73edae7\', \'multiverseId\': 384362}, \'multiverseid\': 384362}, {\'name\': \'Dissipare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo abominio non è mai stato del nostro mondo. Lo sto semplicemente liberando." —Dierk, mago dei geist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7cc3f1-5319-42ba-b567-96025137be51\', \'multiverseId\': 384646}, \'multiverseid\': 384646}, {\'name\': \'雲散霧消\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。その呪文がこれにより打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この忌まわしきものは我々の世界のものではない。単に自由の身にしてやっただけだ。」 ――霊魔道士、ディールク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9461858-19aa-4dc3-9e3c-de58b2d21113\', \'multiverseId\': 384930}, \'multiverseid\': 384930}, {\'name\': \'일소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 이렇게 그 주문이 무효화되면 그 카드를 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 흉물은 절대로 이 세계의 존재가 아니다. 난 단지 자유롭게 풀어줄 뿐이다." —심령술사 디어크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f36c70-5c2b-450b-83d1-0c83bf79e548\', \'multiverseId\': 385214}, \'multiverseid\': 385214}, {\'name\': \'Dissipar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta abominação nunca pertenceu ao nosso mundo. Eu estou apenas libertando-a." — Dierk, geisteomago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bdeb67f-662f-43d5-86d3-ff7cafd19cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 385498}, \'multiverseid\': 385498}, {\'name\': \'Развеивание\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Если то заклинание отменяется таким способом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Этой мерзости никогда не было места в нашем мире. Я просто выпускаю ее на свободу». — Дьерк, маг привидений\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc63ba5-5acb-4665-93da-ab18bcdc5f05\', \'multiverseId\': 385782}, \'multiverseid\': 385782}, {\'name\': \'云消雾散\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这憎恨兽从不属于我们的世界。我只是让它自由。」 ～游魂法师第尔克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2447350d-a909-4f50-9e7f-8ef3d9c2ccd4\', \'multiverseId\': 383510}, \'multiverseid\': 383510}, {\'name\': \'雲消霧散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這憎恨獸從不屬於我們的世界。我只是讓它自由。」 ～遊魂法師第爾克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87dd969a-241b-4ba5-8e66-048a55f6ec5c\', \'multiverseId\': 383794}, \'multiverseid\': 383794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Hinterhalt\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, den nichtgrüne Kreaturen in diesem Zug zufügen würden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Zuerst verlierst du die Spur deines Feindes. Dann verlierst du die Orientierung. Und dann hörst du das Knurren …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc267ae1-07ec-40c6-833d-2bb5d7e815a4\', \'multiverseId\': 384123}, \'multiverseid\': 384123}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada del cazador\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que fueran a hacer las criaturas que no sean verdes este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Primero pierdes el rastro de tu enemigo. Luego pierdes todo sentido de la orientación. Entonces, oyes los gruñidos...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64544e84-bef2-4871-99f2-221133f7cbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 386111}, \'multiverseid\': 386111}, {\'name\': \'Embuscade du chasseur\', \'text\': \'Prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées par des créatures non-vertes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "D\'abord, vous perdez la trace de l\'ennemi. Puis vous vous perdez vous-même. Et enfin vous entendez les grognements...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384407&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07145681-1435-4141-87f7-ab119a7aac82\', \'multiverseId\': 384407}, \'multiverseid\': 384407}, {\'name\': \'Imboscata del Predatore\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto dalle creature non verdi in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Prima perdi le tracce del nemico. Poi perdi il senso dell\'orientamento. Infine, li senti ringhiare...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'840b776d-8442-4b8c-a0fd-d784112d2de2\', \'multiverseId\': 384691}, \'multiverseid\': 384691}, {\'name\': \'狩人の待ち伏せ\', \'text\': \'このターン、緑でないクリーチャーが与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'まず敵の痕跡を見失い、その後に方向の感覚を完全に失う。そして唸り声が聞こえ……\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ebec08-f28b-41ed-95c8-9a77d1aefa42\', \'multiverseId\': 384975}, \'multiverseid\': 384975}, {\'name\': \'사냥꾼의 매복\', \'text\': \'이번 턴에 녹색이 아닌 생물들이 입히려고 하는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'먼저 적의 흔적을 놓친다. 그런 다음 모든 방향 감각을 잃는다. 그러고 나면 으르렁거리는 소리가 들린다...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ee3463-5cbd-4770-960d-cfaa9e7d6730\', \'multiverseId\': 385259}, \'multiverseid\': 385259}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada do Caçador\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano de combate que seria causado por criaturas que não sejam verdes neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro, você perde o rastro do seu inimigo. Depois, você perde o senso de direção. Então, você ouve os rosnados...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d28ccf77-8554-483a-a016-ea9727721d27\', \'multiverseId\': 385543}, \'multiverseid\': 385543}, {\'name\': \'Засада Охотника\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены незелеными существами в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Сначала ты теряешь след своего врага. Потом ты перестаешь понимать, где находишься. А потом ты слышишь рычание...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a3f9a9-5833-483e-bcf2-17e6e6b243b3\', \'multiverseId\': 385827}, \'multiverseid\': 385827}, {\'name\': \'猎者伏击\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止非绿色的生物将造成的所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'首先，你失去敌人踪影。接着，你失去方向感。接下来你听到咆哮声...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd653fd-1466-4ddd-ae41-411f0b8c67bd\', \'multiverseId\': 383555}, \'multiverseid\': 383555}, {\'name\': \'獵者伏擊\', \'text\': \'於本回合中，防止非綠色的生物將造成的所有戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'首先，你失去敵人踪影。接著，你失去方向感。接下來你聽到咆哮聲...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23b4629-03f6-423c-a847-bcb50073e3b3\', \'multiverseId\': 383839}, \'multiverseid\': 383839}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus der Realität lösen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Seelenloser Dämon, du bist an mich gebunden. Nun fristen wir beide unser Dasein in der Vergessenheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247bb925-d8e8-49b6-928c-c85e99a9a7ca\', \'multiverseId\': 384193}, \'multiverseid\': 384193}, {\'name\': \'Arrancar de la realidad\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo que controlas y la criatura objetivo que no controlas a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Demonio sin alma, quedas atado a mí. Ahora ambos moraremos en el olvido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171af607-6a63-41a2-bae8-c8329edca5ed\', \'multiverseId\': 386181}, \'multiverseid\': 386181}, {\'name\': \'Épluchage de réalité\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez et une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Démon sans âme, tu m\'appartiens. L\'heure est venue pour nous de sombrer dans l\'oubli. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379eeae9-1e0c-4f7f-aec8-56f3090d1ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 384477}, \'multiverseid\': 384477}, {\'name\': \'Rimuovere dalla Realtà\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio che controlli e una creatura bersaglio che non controlli in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Demone senz\\\'anima, sei legato a me a doppio filo. Vagheremo entrambi nell\\\'oblio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e297d186-949c-471c-bb7d-e394b69e289d\', \'multiverseId\': 384761}, \'multiverseid\': 384761}, {\'name\': \'現実からの剥離\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「魂無き悪魔よ、貴様をこの身に縛り付けてやった。我らは共に忘却の中に住まうのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d2d8c3d-6a1d-4443-bf23-d652bc96a9a1\', \'multiverseId\': 385045}, \'multiverseid\': 385045}, {\'name\': \'실체 격리\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"영혼 없는 악마야, 넌 이제 내게서 벗어날 수 없다. 같이 망각으로 가는 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a609e1b-52f4-4e3a-827f-3e5617be43e7\', \'multiverseId\': 385329}, \'multiverseid\': 385329}, {\'name\': \'Despir da Realidade\', \'text\': \'Devolva uma criatura alvo que você controle e uma criatura alvo que você não controle para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Demônio desalmado, você está preso a mim. Agora ambos habitaremos no esquecimento."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0d246b-e575-491f-8579-8ad89a44bc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 385613}, \'multiverseid\': 385613}, {\'name\': \'Бегство от Реальности\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое существо, которое вы контролируете, и целевое существо, которое вы не контролируете, в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Бездушный демон, мы с тобой связаны. Теперь мы оба растворимся в забвении».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e45d3a9-0705-414e-a459-39937a2d3857\', \'multiverseId\': 385897}, \'multiverseid\': 385897}, {\'name\': \'实界剥除\', \'text\': \'将目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「卑鄙恶魔，你逃不开我了。如今我们将同遭遗忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2276658-608a-47d1-afaf-4f7d4ae292e9\', \'multiverseId\': 383625}, \'multiverseid\': 383625}, {\'name\': \'實界剝除\', \'text\': \'將目標由你操控的生物與目標不由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「卑鄙惡魔，你逃不開我了。如今我們將同遭遺忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c989d747-1ee9-4ad9-9e02-1eeec814be67\', \'multiverseId\': 383909}, \'multiverseid\': 383909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyn der Schutzengel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\n{1}{W}: Verhindere allen Schaden, der in diesem Zug einer anderen Kreatur deiner Wahl von Quellen einer Farbe, die du bestimmst, zugefügt würde.\\n{5}{W}{W}: Verhindere allen Schaden, der in diesem Zug einem Spieler deiner Wahl von Quellen einer Farbe, die du bestimmst, zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa77837-d5e3-4927-a2b5-088772e6d341\', \'multiverseId\': 384037}, \'multiverseid\': 384037}, {\'name\': \'Avacyn, ángel de la guarda\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\n{1}{W}: Prevén todo el daño que las fuentes del color de tu elección fueran a hacerle a otra criatura objetivo este turno.\\n{5}{W}{W}: Prevén todo el daño que las fuentes del color de tu elección fueran a hacerle al jugador objetivo este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d5be7cf-1280-43a3-96d6-6fe694702c58\', \'multiverseId\': 386025}, \'multiverseid\': 386025}, {\'name\': \'Avacyn, ange gardien\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\\n{1}{W} : Prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à une autre créature ciblée par des sources de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{5}{W}{W} : Prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées au joueur ciblé par des sources de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384321&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83779bc3-2fec-4f5b-ba89-fafaa260d318\', \'multiverseId\': 384321}, \'multiverseid\': 384321}, {\'name\': \'Avacyn, Angelo Custode\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\n{1}{W}: Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a un\'altra creatura bersaglio in questo turno da fonti di un colore a tua scelta.\\n{5}{W}{W}: Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a un giocatore bersaglio in questo turno da fonti di un colore a tua scelta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470e00af-03ec-45c5-872a-182c384c6361\', \'multiverseId\': 384605}, \'multiverseid\': 384605}, {\'name\': \'守護天使アヴァシン\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n{1}{W}：他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、あなたが選んだ色１色を持つ発生源がそれに与えるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\n{5}{W}{W}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。このターン、あなたが選んだ色１色を持つ発生源からそのプレイヤーに与えられるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f00cbb2-b656-46f1-b7d6-4c16f38a54c7\', \'multiverseId\': 384889}, \'multiverseid\': 384889}, {\'name\': \'수호천사 아바신\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\\n{1}{W}: 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신이 선택한 색의 원천이 이 턴에 그 생물에게 입힐 모든 피해를 방지한다.\\n{5}{W}{W}: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 당신이 선택한 색의 원천이 이 턴에 그 플레이어에게 입힐 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b70e61-2873-4255-9235-e11926ccb9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 385173}, \'multiverseid\': 385173}, {\'name\': \'Avacyn, Anjo da Guarda\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\n{1}{W}: Previna todo o dano que seria causado a outra criatura alvo neste turno por fontes de uma cor à sua escolha.\\n{5}{W}{W}: Previna todo o dano que seria causado ao jogador alvo neste turno por fontes de uma cor à sua escolha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed5332f-a0a0-434f-a7af-abb902113b11\', \'multiverseId\': 385457}, \'multiverseid\': 385457}, {\'name\': \'Авацина, Ангел-Хранитель\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\\n{1}{W}: предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены другому целевому существу в этом ходу источниками выбранного вами цвета.\\n{5}{W}{W}: предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены целевому игроку в этом ходу источниками выбранного вами цвета.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'680e1c23-a782-4812-81e4-a76d9b3bb5ec\', \'multiverseId\': 385741}, \'multiverseid\': 385741}, {\'name\': \'守护天使艾维欣\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n{1}{W}：选择一种颜色。于本回合中，防止该色来源将对另一个目标生物造成的所有伤害。\\n{5}{W}{W}：选择一种颜色。于本回合中，防止该色来源将对目标牌手造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5836b00f-10fc-42d3-bade-4c156bab9cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 383469}, \'multiverseid\': 383469}, {\'name\': \'守護天使艾維欣\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\\n{1}{W}：選擇一種顏色。於本回合中，防止該色來源將對另一個目標生物造成的所有傷害。\\n{5}{W}{W}：選擇一種顏色。於本回合中，防止該色來源將對目標玩家造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5264b7-8518-43c1-938b-fccb230194f1\', \'multiverseId\': 383753}, \'multiverseid\': 383753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behütender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Behütende Engel ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl solange Unzerstörbarkeit, wie du den Behütenden Engel kontrollierst. (Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht. Eine Kreatur mit Unzerstörbarkeit kann nicht von Schaden zerstört werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5945c5-f429-4875-882d-4e6d75e7204d\', \'multiverseId\': 384012}, \'multiverseid\': 384012}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la égida\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)\\nCuando el Ángel de la égida entre al campo de batalla, otro permanente objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible mientras controles el Ángel de la égida. (Los efectos que dicen "destruye" no lo destruyen. Una criatura con la habilidad de indestructible no puede ser destruida por daño.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30e1ceb0-ad52-4405-be55-2438ce063c28\', \'multiverseId\': 386000}, \'multiverseid\': 386000}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'égide", \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'égide arrive sur le champ de bataille, un autre permanent ciblé acquiert l\'indestructible tant que vous contrôlez l\'Ange de l\'égide. (Les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne détruisent pas ce permanent. Une créature avec l\'indestructible ne peut pas être détruite par des blessures.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384296&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d220209c-992e-4a0e-8bbe-edbced140ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 384296}, \'multiverseid\': 384296}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Egida", \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)\\nQuando l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida entra nel campo di battaglia, un altro permanente bersaglio ha indistruttibile fintanto che controlli l\\\'Angelo dell\\\'Egida. (Gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non lo distruggono. Una creatura con indistruttibile non può essere distrutta dal danno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'494181ce-648b-4b11-8613-690a8c0a3577\', \'multiverseId\': 384580}, \'multiverseid\': 384580}, {\'name\': \'神盾の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行（このクリーチャーは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）\\n神盾の天使が戦場に出たとき、他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたが神盾の天使をコントロールし続けているかぎり、それは破壊不能を得る。（「破壊する」効果では、それは破壊されない。破壊不能を持つクリーチャーはダメージによって破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52be7bac-e156-4ca1-8b27-b18bf3a5d1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 384864}, \'multiverseid\': 384864}, {\'name\': \'보호의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행 (이 생물은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n보호의 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물은 당신이 보호의 천사를 조종하는 한 무적을 얻는다. ("파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다. 무적을 가진 생물은 피해를 입어 파괴될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bbca5a8-f331-4e87-b179-27f1a5d50205\', \'multiverseId\': 385148}, \'multiverseid\': 385148}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Égide\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)\\nQuando Anjo da Égide entra no campo de batalha, outra permanente alvo ganha indestrutível enquanto você controlar Anjo da Égide. (Os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não a destroem. Uma criatura com indestrutível não pode ser destruída por dano.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8f002a-945b-4b8b-9334-ee34b23f6a89\', \'multiverseId\': 385432}, \'multiverseid\': 385432}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Эгиды\', \'text\': \'Полет (Это существо может быть заблокировано только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)\\nКогда Ангел Эгиды выходит на поле битвы, другой целевой перманент получает Неразрушимость, пока вы контролируете Ангела Эгиды. (Эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают его. Существо с Неразрушимостью нельзя уничтожить повреждениями.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be2c739f-059d-4841-921e-e994ef99995f\', \'multiverseId\': 385716}, \'multiverseid\': 385716}, {\'name\': \'庇护天使\', \'text\': \'飞行（此生物只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）\\n当庇护天使进战场时，于你操控庇护天使的时段内，另一个目标永久物获得不灭异能。（注明「消灭」的效应不会消灭它。伤害无法消灭具不灭异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec521f0-cacf-4374-95fd-dc9df0ccbb74\', \'multiverseId\': 383444}, \'multiverseid\': 383444}, {\'name\': \'庇護天使\', \'text\': \'飛行（此生物只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）\\n當庇護天使進戰場時，於你操控庇護天使的時段內，另一個目標永久物獲得不滅異能。（註明「消滅」的效應不會消滅它。傷害無法消滅具不滅異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03f92db-90fe-48c3-aa04-5e8f033d52a0\', \'multiverseId\': 383728}, \'multiverseid\': 383728}]', "[{'name': 'Belagerungsdrache', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Belagerungsdrache ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre alle Mauern, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.\\nImmer wenn der Belagerungsdrache angreift und falls der verteidigende Spieler keine Mauer kontrolliert, fügt er jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Drache', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384233&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aeec499d-05f1-4d3c-b280-1650b74094f6', 'multiverseId': 384233}, 'multiverseid': 384233}, {'name': 'Dragón de asedio', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón de asedio entre al campo de batalla, destruye todos los Muros que controlan tus oponentes.\\nSiempre que el Dragón de asedio ataque, si el jugador defensor no controla ningún Muro, le hace 2 puntos de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar que controla ese jugador.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragón', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd069986f-d9e9-4063-899d-e134b3a2b2c8', 'multiverseId': 386221}, 'multiverseid': 386221}, {'name': 'Dragon de siège', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Dragon de siège arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez tous les murs que vos adversaires contrôlent.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon de siège attaque, si le joueur défenseur ne contrôle pas de mur, il inflige 2 blessures à chaque créature sans le vol que ce joueur contrôle.', 'type': 'Créature : dragon', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384517&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e392f41b-c291-4dda-86b0-080b8292291d', 'multiverseId': 384517}, 'multiverseid': 384517}, {'name': 'Drago da Assedio', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Drago da Assedio entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi tutti i Muri controllati dai tuoi avversari.\\nOgniqualvolta il Drago da Assedio attacca, se il giocatore in difesa non controlla alcun Muro, il Drago da Assedio infligge 2 danni a ogni creatura senza volare controllata da quel giocatore.', 'type': 'Creatura — Drago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384801&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbe5e185-74e5-4b96-98be-c2d012e900c0', 'multiverseId': 384801}, 'multiverseid': 384801}, {'name': '包囲ドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n包囲ドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするすべての壁を破壊する。\\n包囲ドラゴンが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーが壁をコントロールしていない場合、これはそのプレイヤーがコントロールする飛行を持たない各クリーチャーに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385085&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83638211-3410-4340-8dc4-ed4c3a74c1ff', 'multiverseId': 385085}, 'multiverseid': 385085}, {'name': '공성 용', 'text': '비행\\n공성 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 상대가 조종하는 모든 벽을 파괴한다.\\n공성 용이 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어가 조종하는 벽이 없다면, 공성 용은 그 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 중 비행이 없는 각 생물에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.', 'type': '생물 — 용', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385369&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a37322f-e3e1-40d4-b73f-c526ff7bdac4', 'multiverseId': 385369}, 'multiverseid': 385369}, {'name': 'Dragão de Cerco', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Dragão de Cerco entrar no campo de batalha, destrua todas as Barreiras que seus oponentes controlam.\\nToda vez que Dragão de Cerco atacar, se o jogador defensor não controlar nenhuma Barreira, ele causará 2 pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar que aquele jogador controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385653&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e47d8c7d-9249-465a-8332-4db77ee5db55', 'multiverseId': 385653}, 'multiverseid': 385653}, {'name': 'Осадный Дракон', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Осадный Дракон выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте все Стены под контролем ваших оппонентов.\\nКаждый раз, когда Осадный Дракон атакует, если под контролем защищающегося игрока нет Стен, он наносит 2 повреждения каждому существу без Полета под контролем того игрока.', 'type': 'Существо — Дракон', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385937&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdb86bff-dee3-429c-9bcb-f6486a36898f', 'multiverseId': 385937}, 'multiverseid': 385937}, {'name': '攻城巨龙', 'text': '飞行\\n当攻城巨龙进战场时，消灭所有由对手操控的墙。\\n每当攻城巨龙攻击时，若防御牌手未操控墙，则它对每个由该牌手操控且不具飞行异能的生物各造成2点伤害。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383665&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2be27840-26db-46ef-8b43-7db8fca953f7', 'multiverseId': 383665}, 'multiverseid': 383665}, {'name': '攻城巨龍', 'text': '飛行\\n當攻城巨龍進戰場時，消滅所有由對手操控的牆。\\n每當攻城巨龍攻擊時，若防禦玩家未操控牆，則它對每個由該玩家操控且不具飛行異能的生物各造成2點傷害。', 'type': '生物～龍', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383949&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc273610-4c5f-44be-a2cc-ad8f72845f2a', 'multiverseId': 383949}, 'multiverseid': 383949}]", '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungswurm\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Jede Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, reduziert dessen Kosten um {1} oder um ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden (Falls diese Kreatur ihren Blockern genug Schaden zuweisen würde, um sie zu zerstören, kannst du sie den Rest des Schadens dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zuweisen lassen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7daf8b0f-e3e2-479c-8432-8a43c2e321dd\', \'multiverseId\': 384234}, \'multiverseid\': 384234}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de asedio\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nArrolla. (Si esta criatura fuera a asignar suficiente daño a sus bloqueadores como para destruirlos, puedes hacer que le asigne el resto del daño al jugador o planeswalker defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'332b75d4-8d60-4af8-8823-c0788d666647\', \'multiverseId\': 386222}, \'multiverseid\': 386222}, {\'name\': \'Guivre de siège\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nPiétinement (Si cette créature attribue suffisamment de blessures de combat à ses bloqueurs pour les détruire, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle attribue le reste de ses blessures au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1eb72d2-ff9d-45c5-a46e-6ddb1f0c1599\', \'multiverseId\': 384518}, \'multiverseid\': 384518}, {\'name\': \'Wurm da Assedio\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nTravolgere (Se questa creatura sta per assegnare alle sue creature bloccanti danno sufficiente a distruggerle, puoi farle assegnare il resto del suo danno al giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5575bf8c-0e68-4a45-92ff-73c512094c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 384802}, \'multiverseid\': 384802}, {\'name\': \'包囲ワーム\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nトランプル（このクリーチャーが、自身をブロックしているすべてのクリーチャーを破壊するのに十分なダメージを割り振ったなら、あなたはこれの残りのダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに割り振ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3107fdb8-0eed-41bb-a798-1d0b446bc7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 385086}, \'multiverseid\': 385086}, {\'name\': \'공성 웜\', \'text\': \'집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동할 때 탭하는 생물 한 개당 이 주문의 비용은 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색인 마나 한 개만큼 줄어든다.)\\n돌진 (이 생물이 자신을 방어하는 생물을 파괴하기에 충분한 피해를 배정했다면, 나머지 피해는 수비플레이어나 플레인즈워커에게 배정할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35181490-06c1-457b-ad80-7d4034fa0c52\', \'multiverseId\': 385370}, \'multiverseid\': 385370}, {\'name\': \'Vorme de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nAtropelar (Se esta criatura for atribuir dano suficiente para destruir seus bloqueadores, você poderá fazer com que ela atribua o resto de seu dano ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651cd482-fad7-41d8-bd0d-c885308f4170\', \'multiverseId\': 385654}, \'multiverseid\': 385654}, {\'name\': \'Осадный Вурм\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nПробивной удар (Если это существо распределяет достаточно повреждений, чтобы уничтожить блокирующие его существа, вы можете заставить его распределить оставшиеся повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0fd9d43-4cc7-4457-9ba1-997872a02827\', \'multiverseId\': 385938}, \'multiverseid\': 385938}, {\'name\': \'攻城亚龙\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n践踏（如果此生物将分配的伤害足以消灭所有阻挡它的生物，你可以将它所剩余数量的伤害分配给防御牌手或鹏洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b791fae-c8a2-4361-89e0-fe0913dbcf3c\', \'multiverseId\': 383666}, \'multiverseid\': 383666}, {\'name\': \'攻城亞龍\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n踐踏（如果此生物將分配的傷害足以消滅所有阻擋它的生物，你可以將它所剩餘數量的傷害分配給防禦玩家或鵬洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e35539-2147-4a50-a1fa-f74857f10048\', \'multiverseId\': 383950}, \'multiverseid\': 383950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewohner des Schmelzenwegs\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere rote Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Bewohner des Schmelzenwegs +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Nach den Unruhen im Schmelzenweg versuchte Eintreiber Hulbein, Knüppel zu verbieten. Was natürlich weitere Unruhen nach sich zog.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7603708-c82c-4d2c-b410-a1e5c1d90509\', \'multiverseId\': 384098}, \'multiverseid\': 384098}, {\'name\': \'Habitante de la Calle Fundición\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura roja entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Habitante de la Calle Fundición obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Tras el motín de la Calle Fundición, el encarcelador Hulbein intentó prohibir las porras. Lo cual, inevitablemente, acabó en otro motín.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d3aa20-3980-4f43-afef-c718dac6e171\', \'multiverseId\': 386086}, \'multiverseid\': 386086}, {\'name\': \'Habitant de la rue de la Fonderie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature rouge arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, l\'Habitant de la rue de la Fonderie gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Suite à l\'émeute de la rue de la Fonderie, le courtier Hulbein tenta de prohiber les armes contondantes. Ce qui, inévitablement, entraîna une nouvelle émeute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e387721e-f954-4189-8c0d-382678a7797a\', \'multiverseId\': 384382}, \'multiverseid\': 384382}, {\'name\': \'Abitante di Via della Fonderia\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura rossa entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Abitante di Via della Fonderia prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Dopo la sommossa di Via della Fonderia, Hulbein della polizia cercò di mettere fuori legge i randelli. Il che, inevitabilmente, produsse un\'altra sommossa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7fcb3e8-982b-4649-89b4-7dee02921b97\', \'multiverseId\': 384666}, \'multiverseid\': 384666}, {\'name\': \'鋳造所通りの住人\', \'text\': \'他の赤のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、鋳造所通りの住人はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'鋳造所通りの暴動の後、拘引者フルベインは棍棒を禁制品にしようとした。必然的にまたひとつ暴動が起こった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c87e54b-5b32-4194-b056-1cc650d82b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 384950}, \'multiverseid\': 384950}, {\'name\': \'주조소 거리 거주민\', \'text\': \'당신의 조종하에 다른 적색 생물이 전장에 들어올 때마다, 주조소 거리 거주민은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'주조소 거리에서 폭동이 발생한 후, 체포원 헐베인은 몽둥이 휴대를 금지하려 했다. 그러자 자연스럽게 몽둥이 휴대 금지를 반대하는 폭동이 발생했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dce98ea-aa6a-4d9d-a0bc-7948cd3387fe\', \'multiverseId\': 385234}, \'multiverseid\': 385234}, {\'name\': \'Habitante da Rua da Fundição\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura vermelha entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, Habitante da Rua da Fundição recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Depois da revolta da Rua da Fundição, o Encarcerador Hulbein tentou banir as bordunas. O que, inevitavelmente, resultou em outra revolta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab088d0-9eec-4dad-85f5-95e235d6dea8\', \'multiverseId\': 385518}, \'multiverseid\': 385518}, {\'name\': \'Житель Литейной Улицы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое красное существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Житель Литейной Улицы получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'После бунта на Литейной улице задержатель Гульбейн попытался запретить кувалды. Само собой, это привело к очередному бунту.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f213b03-e5b9-45ed-9a63-db64d114d702\', \'multiverseId\': 385802}, \'multiverseid\': 385802}, {\'name\': \'锻炉街居民\', \'text\': \'每当另一个红色生物在你的操控下进战场时，锻炉街居民得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在锻炉街暴乱后，逮捕人胡边试图禁止使用棍棒。这当然引发了另一场暴乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f129cc-5562-4143-96ee-53882ad83abc\', \'multiverseId\': 383530}, \'multiverseid\': 383530}, {\'name\': \'鍛爐街居民\', \'text\': \'每當另一個紅色生物在你的操控下進戰場時，鍛爐街居民得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'在鍛爐街暴亂後，逮捕人胡邊試圖禁止使用棍棒。這當然引發了另一場暴亂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5a16c7-4b1f-47de-94e4-c9961483ea6c\', \'multiverseId\': 383814}, \'multiverseid\': 383814}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzeinschlag\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzeinschlag fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Blitze zu schleudern bedeutet, das Chaos zu zähmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384151&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47833895-0ea0-45cb-a057-ed641d642c92\', \'multiverseId\': 384151}, \'multiverseid\': 384151}, {\'name\': \'Descarga de rayos\', \'text\': \'La Descarga de rayos hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Blandir el rayo es domar el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca7e257-14ef-4f06-b570-fbbebf3f9ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 386139}, \'multiverseid\': 386139}, {\'name\': \'Frappe foudroyante\', \'text\': \'La Frappe foudroyante inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Manipuler la foudre, c\'est apprivoiser le chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06459bfc-3da4-4a53-b964-c80e5983317a\', \'multiverseId\': 384435}, \'multiverseid\': 384435}, {\'name\': \'Colpo di Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Il Colpo di Fulmine infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Controllare il fulmine significa domare il caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c86ea3-bc15-461f-8cd7-cc3bc40922f5\', \'multiverseId\': 384719}, \'multiverseid\': 384719}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻の一撃はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻を操るということは、混沌を制御することを意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07dd7589-99d6-4a1f-a25b-846de224dbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 385003}, \'multiverseid\': 385003}, {\'name\': \'번개 강타\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 번개 강타는 그 목표에 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'번개를 다루려면 혼돈을 길들여야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb65d433-c954-4a77-ba13-27ef7142c3db\', \'multiverseId\': 385287}, \'multiverseid\': 385287}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Relampejante\', \'text\': \'Golpe Relampejante causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Manipular um raio é domar o caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d93aa4-4e7b-4379-82a6-855331fa7a13\', \'multiverseId\': 385571}, \'multiverseid\': 385571}, {\'name\': \'Удар Грома\', \'text\': \'Удар Грома наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Повелевающий молниями обуздал хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4130c918-54b1-4737-8820-9c2adb180fc3\', \'multiverseId\': 385855}, \'multiverseid\': 385855}, {\'name\': \'闪电炼击\', \'text\': \'闪电炼击对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'召使闪电就如同驾驭混乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5c0daf-7925-4e74-b81e-563c6e1a73df\', \'multiverseId\': 383583}, \'multiverseid\': 383583}, {\'name\': \'閃電煉擊\', \'text\': \'閃電煉擊對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'召使閃電就如同駕馭混亂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b32f8ae-a48a-4dd3-8395-614504ad5011\', \'multiverseId\': 383867}, \'multiverseid\': 383867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutgieriger Gastgeber\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutgierigen Gastgeber und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Einladung auszuschlagen, wäre unhöflich. Sie anzunehmen, wäre unklug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2866c240-7c1a-4316-9f31-8a113d495ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 384045}, \'multiverseid\': 384045}, {\'name\': \'Anfitrión sangriento\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Anfitrión sangriento y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Sería una falta de educación rehusar su invitación… y una falta de sentido común aceptarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ed1ec4e-ad4e-4242-a1c8-c98aba7f44ff\', \'multiverseId\': 386033}, \'multiverseid\': 386033}, {\'name\': \'Hôte de sang\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hôte de sang et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "Il serait malpoli de refuser son invitation. Il serait mal avisé de l\'accepter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384329&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52598715-0506-4af1-8345-30ffc5ee228e\', \'multiverseId\': 384329}, \'multiverseid\': 384329}, {\'name\': \'Anfitrione Sanguinario\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Anfitrione Sanguinario e guadagni 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Rifiutare il suo invito sarebbe poco cortese. Accettarlo sarebbe poco saggio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73d3180-69a3-4696-9e67-bce19e4c6c70\', \'multiverseId\': 384613}, \'multiverseid\': 384613}, {\'name\': \'血の宿主\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, 他のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：血の宿主の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'彼の招待を辞退するのは非礼な行為である。彼の招待を受諾するのは軽率な行為である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11d77cdf-f7e7-47f2-8cce-0742f87b97c7\', \'multiverseId\': 384897}, \'multiverseid\': 384897}, {\'name\': \'피의 주인\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, 다른 생물을 희생한다: 피의 주인에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'그의 초대를 거절하는 것은 결례다. 그의 초대를 수락하는 것은 무모함이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb069a6-4c7a-429b-b70f-2d798d61b6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 385181}, \'multiverseid\': 385181}, {\'name\': \'Anfitrião Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifique outra criatura: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Anfitrião Sanguinário e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Seria falta de educação negar o convite dele. Seria falta de inteligência aceitá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd03eee-7c3e-4098-b43d-143f61587117\', \'multiverseId\': 385465}, \'multiverseid\': 385465}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Хозяин\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, пожертвуйте другое существо: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Кровавого Хозяина, и вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'Отклонить его приглашение будет невежливо. Принять его приглашение будет неразумно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e392be-a139-4705-8101-d51cab3b6342\', \'multiverseId\': 385749}, \'multiverseid\': 385749}, {\'name\': \'血宴东主\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，牺牲另一个生物：在血宴东主上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'拒绝他的邀请有失礼数。接受他的邀请有失明智。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2e356d-ea1e-49fa-8c4d-a82642ce2621\', \'multiverseId\': 383477}, \'multiverseid\': 383477}, {\'name\': \'血宴東主\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，犧牲另一個生物：在血宴東主上放置一個+1/+1指示物，且你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'拒絕他的邀請有失禮數。接受他的邀請有失明智。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023cbc71-6768-4118-8446-e57d237433fe\', \'multiverseId\': 383761}, \'multiverseid\': 383761}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutpakt\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Jede Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, reduziert dessen Kosten um {1} oder um ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nDer Blutpakt fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu, und du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19420b54-7df0-42bd-ba3b-8b8a85622727\', \'multiverseId\': 384069}, \'multiverseid\': 384069}, {\'name\': \'Pacto de sangre\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nEl Pacto de sangre hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo y tú ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad89d117-0a1b-44b4-83d8-e87bf904d0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 386057}, \'multiverseid\': 386057}, {\'name\': \'Pacte de sang\', \'text\': \'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nLe Pacte de sang inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur, et vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ab236d0-9c2c-4ac8-a30b-82e360e156d9\', \'multiverseId\': 384353}, \'multiverseid\': 384353}, {\'name\': \'Accordo di Sangue\', \'text\': "Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nL\'Accordo di Sangue infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio e tu guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c44bf0-b419-4764-87fc-1d27998e789f\', \'multiverseId\': 384637}, \'multiverseid\': 384637}, {\'name\': \'血の誓約\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。血の誓約はそれに４点のダメージを与え、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e5707a-f10c-4169-82bf-0a2fa1229f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 384921}, \'multiverseid\': 384921}, {\'name\': \'피의 계약\', \'text\': \'집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동할 때 탭하는 생물 한 개당 이 주문의 비용은 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색인 마나 한 개만큼 줄어든다.)\\n생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 피의 계약은 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입히고 당신은 생명 4점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876bdfda-d60e-4cd6-a9cd-8ff5bd65a88f\', \'multiverseId\': 385205}, \'multiverseid\': 385205}, {\'name\': \'Conluio de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nConluio de Sangue causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo e você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'297b2768-fa7f-4dc2-9a31-3cca89e28291\', \'multiverseId\': 385489}, \'multiverseid\': 385489}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Завет\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nКровавый Завет наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или игроку, а вы получаете 4 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013aadd2-8e2d-47fc-80e8-16be9ef68a86\', \'multiverseId\': 385773}, \'multiverseid\': 385773}, {\'name\': \'鲜血盟约\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n鲜血盟约对目标生物或牌手造成4点伤害，且你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b903038-6c75-4224-b1ad-3a3eb680d318\', \'multiverseId\': 383501}, \'multiverseid\': 383501}, {\'name\': \'鮮血盟約\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n鮮血盟約對目標生物或玩家造成4點傷害，且你獲得4點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5438db8d-34b6-443e-9ee1-c15ccbb88ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 383785}, \'multiverseid\': 383785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsauger-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Remasuri, den du kontrollierst, angreift, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Als ich sah, wie einer von ihnen langsam einen meiner Leute verschlang, fragte ich mich: Wissen sie überhaupt, was Grausamkeit ist?" —Hastric, Thune-Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385d61a4-e29d-43ec-b174-34cab4c12a10\', \'multiverseId\': 384149}, \'multiverseid\': 384149}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado sanguijuela\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Fragmentado que controlas ataque, el jugador defensor pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ver a uno de ellos devorar lentamente a un miembro de mi grupo me hizo preguntarme si saben lo que es la crueldad". —Hastric, explorador de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81ad31d-e156-4ebe-9bfb-bdb771abc6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 386137}, \'multiverseid\': 386137}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde sangsue\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un slivoïde que vous contrôlez attaque, le joueur défenseur perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« La question s\'est posée quand j\'en ai vu un dévorer lentement l\'un de mes compagnons : ont-ils conscience de ce qu\'est la cruauté ? » —Hastric, éclaireur thiunien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c2ae32-2346-4f53-adbf-a610c403c4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 384433}, \'multiverseid\': 384433}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Sanguisuga\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Tramutante che controlli attacca, il giocatore in difesa perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"Vederne uno divorare lentamente un membro della mia squadra mi ha spinto a chiedermi se sappiano cosa sia la crudeltà." —Hastric, esploratore di Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e52878-7021-43c3-a95c-50a62faddb02\', \'multiverseId\': 384717}, \'multiverseid\': 384717}, {\'name\': \'血吸いスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするスリヴァーが１体攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「それが我が隊の隊員をゆっくりと貪り食う様を見ているうちに、ある疑問が頭に浮かんだ。この者たちは残忍性というものを知っているのだろうか？」 ――テューンの斥候、ハストリック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46fb996c-d736-4e8d-90f6-39f9efb8ecc3\', \'multiverseId\': 385001}, \'multiverseid\': 385001}, {\'name\': \'거머리 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버가 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'"나의 부대원 한 명을 천천히 잡아먹는 모습을 본 이가 물었다—저것들은 잔인함이 무엇인지 압니까?" —쑨의 정찰병 하스트릭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9770190-d49a-4cfe-ae59-1f892d1a3e93\', \'multiverseId\': 385285}, \'multiverseid\': 385285}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Sugador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Fractius que você controla ataca, o jogador defensor perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Ao ver um deles devorar lentamente um membro do meu grupo, pensei: será que eles sabem o que é crueldade?" — Hastric, batedor thuniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3ab836c-9b69-45e6-b8f1-c5ecb238772a\', \'multiverseId\': 385569}, \'multiverseid\': 385569}, {\'name\': \'Кровососущая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Щепка под вашим контролем атакует, защищающийся игрок теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда я увидел, как одно из таких существ медленно пожирает бойца из моего отряда, то задался вопросом: а не знакомо ли им понятие жестокости?» — Хастрик, тунский разведчик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599aef87-ece4-4e7c-afc5-536ccf8986b4\', \'multiverseId\': 385853}, \'multiverseid\': 385853}, {\'name\': \'吸食裂片妖\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的裂片妖攻击时，防御牌手失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「眼看我的同伴遭其中一员缓慢吞噬，我心中不禁产生了这样的疑问～他们知道什么叫残忍吗？」 ～图恩斥候海司齐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d649a603-c584-4351-a650-79f81a99bb7a\', \'multiverseId\': 383581}, \'multiverseid\': 383581}, {\'name\': \'吸食裂片妖\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的裂片妖攻擊時，防禦玩家失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「眼看我的同伴遭其中一員緩慢吞噬，我心中不禁產生了這樣的疑問～他們知道什麼叫殘忍嗎？」 ～圖恩斥候海司齊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c3284c-426d-4fcc-8dcc-1ed1fb70de59\', \'multiverseId\': 383865}, \'multiverseid\': 383865}]', "[{'name': 'Blühende Zuflucht', 'text': 'Verzaubert ein Land\\nWenn die Blühende Zuflucht ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erhöht sein Beherrscher seinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe (zusätzlich zu dem Mana, das dieses Land erzeugt).', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384279&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ac2e25-a5eb-4114-a209-24f0444ab0c9', 'multiverseId': 384279}, 'multiverseid': 384279}, {'name': 'Refugio verde', 'text': 'Encantar tierra.\\nCuando el Refugio verde entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná de cualquier color a su reserva de maná (además del maná que produce la tierra).', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386267&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4404eac9-d54b-49f2-aeaa-cc431783af37', 'multiverseId': 386267}, 'multiverseid': 386267}, {'name': 'Havre verdoyant', 'text': 'Enchanter : terrain\\nQuand le Havre verdoyant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un mana de la couleur de son choix à sa réserve (en plus du mana produit par le terrain).', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384563&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06a4ad51-9b18-4d86-ae0f-eb60ea8a67de', 'multiverseId': 384563}, 'multiverseid': 384563}, {'name': 'Rifugio Verdeggiante', 'text': 'Incanta terra\\nQuando il Rifugio Verdeggiante entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge un mana di qualsiasi colore alla sua riserva di mana (in aggiunta al mana prodotto dalla terra).', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384847&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '564f106e-1fd8-42b1-a638-6078d56bdcff', 'multiverseId': 384847}, 'multiverseid': 384847}, {'name': '新緑の安息所', 'text': 'エンチャント（土地）\\n新緑の安息所が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーのマナ・プールに好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える（その土地が生み出すマナに追加される）。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385131&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4665563f-6e96-4217-a814-9e6f971ac494', 'multiverseId': 385131}, 'multiverseid': 385131}, {'name': '신록의 피난처', 'text': '대지에 부여\\n신록의 피난처가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n부여된 대지를 탭해 마나를 얻을 때마다 그 조종자는 (그 대지가 원래 생산하는 마나에 더해) 자신의 마나풀에 자신이 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385415&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c79482d-7508-4909-b39b-828c43997025', 'multiverseId': 385415}, 'multiverseid': 385415}, {'name': 'Refúgio Verdejante', 'text': 'Encantar terreno\\nQuando Refúgio Verdejante entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado for virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adicionará um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana (além do mana que o terreno gera).', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385699&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbf6f18f-3281-4a31-bee1-a45e6715fbc3', 'multiverseId': 385699}, 'multiverseid': 385699}, {'name': 'Зеленое Пристанище', 'text': 'Зачаровать землю\\nКогда Зеленое Пристанище выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованная земля поворачивается для получения маны, контролирующий ее игрок добавляет одну ману любого цвета в свое хранилище маны (в дополнение к мане, которую производит земля).', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385983&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7098a7a2-322c-4085-9976-8476ee1536e1', 'multiverseId': 385983}, 'multiverseid': 385983}, {'name': '新绿庇护地', 'text': '结附于地\\n当新绿庇护地进战场时，你获得2点生命。\\n每当所结附的地横置以产生法术力时，其操控者加一点任意颜色的法术力到其法术力池中。（会得到原本该有的法术力，并加上此份法术力。）', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383711&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4716dbe5-4d5b-4517-ab46-22397b5f913c', 'multiverseId': 383711}, 'multiverseid': 383711}, {'name': '新綠庇護地', 'text': '結附於地\\n當新綠庇護地進戰場時，你獲得2點生命。\\n每當所結附的地橫置以產生魔法力時，其操控者加一點任意顏色的魔法力到其魔法力池中（會得到原本該有的魔法力，並加上此份魔法力）。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383995&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd69a5e50-df1b-41be-b68d-071f6a0185db', 'multiverseId': 383995}, 'multiverseid': 383995}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Wut\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit Wut als deiner Esse kann dein Hammer alles zerschmettern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2bccb1b-452f-4583-bf45-5ece9f6c7c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 384051}, \'multiverseid\': 384051}, {\'name\': \'Cólera ardiente\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene "{T}: Esta criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o jugador objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Si lo forjas con ira, tu martillo podrá aplastar cualquier cosa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773ed611-8035-4700-b2cf-a1dae7309497\', \'multiverseId\': 386039}, \'multiverseid\': 386039}, {\'name\': \'Colère brûlante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a « {T} : Cette créature inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal à sa force. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« En faisant de votre rage votre forge, votre marteau pourra tout écraser. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c8b174b-30a7-449b-8268-64b4554373e4\', \'multiverseId\': 384335}, \'multiverseid\': 384335}, {\'name\': \'Collera Bruciante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{T}: Questa creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Se l\\\'ira è la tua forgia, nulla potrà resistere al tuo martello."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e457b943-cefa-44db-aba4-81c0a7c9b245\', \'multiverseId\': 384619}, \'multiverseid\': 384619}, {\'name\': \'燃え盛る怒り\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは「{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「怒りにまかせて鍛えれば、お前のハンマーはいかなる相手でも倒すことができるようになるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11fa053-0b5d-43b1-b086-545384c9fa2b\', \'multiverseId\': 384903}, \'multiverseid\': 384903}, {\'name\': \'타오르는 분노\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 "{T}: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"분노를 담아 망치를 만들면 뭐든 부술 수 있다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23f7b19d-92c1-4629-8085-eaa2ccf3cf75\', \'multiverseId\': 385187}, \'multiverseid\': 385187}, {\'name\': \'Ódio Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada tem "{T}: Esta criatura causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura ou ao jogador alvo."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Tendo o ódio como forja, seu martelo pode moldar qualquer coisa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c986dc11-6e08-41a5-8db7-a6d4f749d4a9\', \'multiverseId\': 385471}, \'multiverseid\': 385471}, {\'name\': \'Обжигающая Злоба\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо имеет способность «{T}: это существо наносит целевому существу или игроку повреждения, равные своей силе».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда твоя кузница — ярость, твой молот сокрушит что угодно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f6f043-ffdd-43a5-8753-ef8868ec80c0\', \'multiverseId\': 385755}, \'multiverseid\': 385755}, {\'name\': \'怒气成焰\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有「{T}：此生物对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。」\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「你的怒气若能如锻炉般火爆，你的重锤就将无坚不摧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ee1886-129f-48f3-8929-6208ed7a14fe\', \'multiverseId\': 383483}, \'multiverseid\': 383483}, {\'name\': \'怒氣成焰\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物具有「{T}：此生物對目標生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。」\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「你的怒氣若能如鍛爐般火爆，你的重鎚就將無堅不摧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7750f129-3031-4fe2-8be3-305046d4943b\', \'multiverseId\': 383767}, \'multiverseid\': 383767}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzezobel\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Zobel\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auserwählte stand allein zwischen der Horde der Wiedergekehrten und dem Schrein der Karametra und schlug tiefe Furchen in ihre Hundertschaften. Sie wäre wohl überwältigt worden, hätte Karametra nicht die Wächter ihres Schreins erweckt. —Die Theriaden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8259713-8b09-47ea-a0c7-e81955b4550f\', \'multiverseId\': 384049}, \'multiverseid\': 384049}, {\'name\': \'Marta de bronce\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Marta\', \'flavor\': \'La Campeona se hallaba sola entre la horda de los Resurgidos y el altar a Karametra, matando por veintenas a los cientos de enemigos. Habría sido derrotada de no ser por la ayuda de los guardianes del templo a los que despertó Karametra. —La Theríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0604a781-8748-49dd-82aa-c77a0814c6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 386037}, \'multiverseid\': 386037}, {\'name\': \'Zibeline de bronze\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : zibeline\', \'flavor\': "Seule, la Championne tenait tête à la horde des Reparus devant le temple de Karametra, les fauchant par dizaines. Elle aurait été submergée par l\'ennemi sans l\'aide des gardiens du temple, réveillés par Karametra. —La Thériade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384333&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38da502a-b7c2-42d5-909c-3deb8c29e0bb\', \'multiverseId\': 384333}, \'multiverseid\': 384333}, {\'name\': \'Zibellino di Bronzo\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Zibellino\', \'flavor\': "La Campionessa si stagliava solitaria tra l\'orda dei Risvegliati e il santuario di Karametra, abbattendone a decine tra le infinite schiere di nemici. Sarebbe stata sopraffatta, se i guardiani del tempio ridestati da Karametra non fossero giunti in aiuto. —La Theriade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6340ef-77de-458e-a53e-ca0dfb0c470e\', \'multiverseId\': 384617}, \'multiverseid\': 384617}, {\'name\': \'青銅の黒貂\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 黒貂\', \'flavor\': \'女勇者は単身、蘇りし者の軍勢とケイラメトラの神殿の間に立ちはだかり、数百もの敵を相手に何十もの敵を切り倒した。ケイラメトラが呼び覚ました神殿の守護者たちの援護がなければ、恐らく圧倒されていたであろう。 ――「テーリアス」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f12ae36f-d7f0-4c59-863d-750c1497fdc2\', \'multiverseId\': 384901}, \'multiverseid\': 384901}, {\'name\': \'청동 담비\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 담비\', \'flavor\': \'영웅은 카라메트라 신전으로 몰려오는 되살아난 자들의 무리를 홀로 막아서며 수백 명을 베었다. 하지만 카라메트라가 깨운 신전 수호자가 도우러 오지 않았다면 오래 버티지 못했을 것이다. —테리아드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b52652-5c21-4e2f-856b-6d9dfa6cbf1c\', \'multiverseId\': 385185}, \'multiverseid\': 385185}, {\'name\': \'Zibelina de Bronze\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Zibelina\', \'flavor\': \'A Campeã postou-se sozinha entre a horda de Ressurgidos e o santuário de Carametra, abatendo-os às centenas. Ela teria sido subjugada não fosse a ajuda dos guardiões do templo, despertados por Carametra. — A Teríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d85cbd0-73dc-4cfe-8aba-ab5c985b8ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 385469}, \'multiverseid\': 385469}, {\'name\': \'Бронзовый Соболь\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Соболь\', \'flavor\': \'Поборница в одиночестве защищала святилище Караметры от орды Возвращенных, сражая десятки врагов, но ее окружали сотни. Она бы пала, если бы не помощь защитников святилища, которых пробудила Караметра. — Териада\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbffe72-bd7e-47f1-8263-65ca447f0636\', \'multiverseId\': 385753}, \'multiverseid\': 385753}, {\'name\': \'青铜紫貂\', \'type\': \'神器生物～紫貂\', \'flavor\': \'天尊镇守通往卡拉美特拉神殿的要道，独力面对转世者大军。她虽已撂倒众多敌手，但仍身处以一敌百的困境。若非卡拉美特拉及时唤醒殿内守卫前往协助，天尊或将无力回天。 ～《塞洛亚特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20296b9-705c-419a-87f7-03d88ed750b1\', \'multiverseId\': 383481}, \'multiverseid\': 383481}, {\'name\': \'青銅紫貂\', \'type\': \'神器生物～紫貂\', \'flavor\': \'天尊鎮守通往卡拉美特拉神殿的要道，獨力面對轉世者大軍。她雖已撂倒眾多敵手，但仍身處以一敵百的困境。若非卡拉美特拉及時喚醒殿內守衛前往協助，天尊或將無力回天。 ～《塞洛亞特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b951fc-c494-4021-9be2-694b8e36c0c6\', \'multiverseId\': 383765}, \'multiverseid\': 383765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruthüterin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Aura an die Bruthüterin angelegt wird, bringe einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel. Er hat „{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Komm, mein Kleines. Breite deine Schwingen aus, fülle deine Lungen mit Luft und speie zum ersten Mal Feuer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef60a83-3cf0-4b0d-9e93-6a448a095fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 384050}, \'multiverseid\': 384050}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un aura sea anexada a la Guardiana de la progenie, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar. Tiene "{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos, pequeñín. Despliega las alas, hincha los pulmones y libera tu primer aliento ardiente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4022e9c6-404c-4809-b7b1-4a89d7a05685\', \'multiverseId\': 386038}, \'multiverseid\': 386038}, {\'name\': \'Gardienne de progéniture\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une aura devient attachée à la Gardienne de progéniture, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol. Il a « {R} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Va, mon petit. Déploie tes ailes, gonfle tes poumons et expulse ton premier souffle incandescent. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384334&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311499b5-3d84-4232-b83f-489e68a9947a\', \'multiverseId\': 384334}, \'multiverseid\': 384334}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana della Covata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un\\\'Aura viene assegnata alla Guardiana della Covata, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Drago 2/2 rossa con volare. Ha "{R}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vieni, piccolo. Spiega le ali, gonfia i polmoni e scatena il tuo primo soffio infuocato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'180411ed-9e94-4ad0-9526-271d782c42da\', \'multiverseId\': 384618}, \'multiverseid\': 384618}, {\'name\': \'落とし子の守り手\', \'text\': \'オーラが１つ落とし子の守り手につけられた状態になるたび、飛行を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それは「{R}：このクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「さあ、おチビちゃん。羽を伸ばして、大きく息を吸って、そして最初の炎の息を吐き出してごらん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209366bd-e6a1-482e-beb4-fa6de47e0159\', \'multiverseId\': 384902}, \'multiverseid\': 384902}, {\'name\': \'무리 수호자\', \'text\': \'무리 수호자에 마법진이 부착될 때마다, 비행을 가진 2/2 적색 용 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 토큰은 "{R}: 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"어서 와라, 아가야. 날개를 펼치고 숨을 들이쉬렴. 그런 다음 불을 뱉어봐."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb5dae90-35b5-404d-967e-3bb4bb92c662\', \'multiverseId\': 385186}, \'multiverseid\': 385186}, {\'name\': \'Ama da Ninhada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma Aura for anexada a Ama da Ninhada, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura vermelha 2/2 do tipo Dragão com voar. Ela tem "{R}: Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Venha, pequenino. Estique suas asas, encha seus pulmões e solte seu primeiro sopro de fogo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2591396e-2ca0-42e7-ab0e-d543351dfd8d\', \'multiverseId\': 385470}, \'multiverseid\': 385470}, {\'name\': \'Хранительница Выводка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда к Хранительнице Выводка прикрепляется Аура, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 красный Дракон с Полетом. Эта фишка имеет способность «{R}: это существо получает +1/+0 до конца хода».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Давай, малыш. Разверни крылья, вдохни полной грудью и испусти свою первую струю пламени».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e564802b-a747-416d-bbed-6f8394e8c4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 385754}, \'multiverseid\': 385754}, {\'name\': \'育卵师\', \'text\': \'每当任一灵气新结附在育卵师上时，将一个2/2红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物放进战场。它具有「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「来吧，小家伙。伸展你的双翼，深吸一口气，吐出你第一口炎息吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1420d567-3149-4e61-856e-b956565905aa\', \'multiverseId\': 383482}, \'multiverseid\': 383482}, {\'name\': \'育卵師\', \'text\': \'每當任一靈氣新結附在育卵師上時，將一個2/2紅色，具飛行異能的龍衍生生物放進戰場。它具有「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。」\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「來吧，小傢伙。伸展你的雙翼，深吸一口氣，吐出你第一口炎息吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbab8496-2f2b-4109-83f1-e77c6f34b1fb\', \'multiverseId\': 383766}, \'multiverseid\': 383766}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brüllendes Primadox\', \'text\': \'Bringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie sind einfach zu entdecken. Aber willst du überhaupt eines finden?" —Juruk, kalonischer Spurensucher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384216&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d340005-7c28-48bc-97c5-38ecc449b0be\', \'multiverseId\': 384216}, \'multiverseid\': 384216}, {\'name\': \'Primadox rugiente\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una criatura que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Son fáciles de encontrar. La pregunta es: ¿seguro que quieres encontrar uno?" —Juruk, rastreador kaloniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44325168-a943-4f42-b566-3631fb80a64a\', \'multiverseId\': 386204}, \'multiverseid\': 386204}, {\'name\': \'Primadox rugissant\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, renvoyez une créature que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils sont faciles à trouver. Mais tenez-vous vraiment à en trouver un ? » —Juruk, traqueur kalonien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0213f6ee-7c9d-4f68-83b0-27ce63d5042f\', \'multiverseId\': 384500}, \'multiverseid\': 384500}, {\'name\': \'Primadox Ruggente\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, fai tornare una creatura che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono abbastanza facili da trovare. La domanda è: sei sicuro che vuoi trovarne uno?" —Juruk, battipista di Kalonia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd0cfe1-37c5-42f9-9be1-850b036b3dfd\', \'multiverseId\': 384784}, \'multiverseid\': 384784}, {\'name\': \'咆哮するプリマドックス\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「見つけるのは簡単だ。問題は、あんたが本当に見つけたいかどうかだ。」 ――カロニアの追跡者ジュラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe560ce7-cc2a-4e5f-8ee9-e55b9c221d18\', \'multiverseId\': 385068}, \'multiverseid\': 385068}, {\'name\': \'울부짖는 프리마독스\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"그걸 찾는 거야 어렵진 않지. 문제는 당신이 정말로 찾고 싶어 하느냐는 것이야." —칼로니아의 사냥꾼 주루크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54905eb0-a612-4dc9-a080-6449aaacaa45\', \'multiverseId\': 385352}, \'multiverseid\': 385352}, {\'name\': \'Primadox Rugidor\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, devolva uma criatura que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles são muito fáceis de se encontrar. A questão é: você quer realmente encontrar um?" — Juruk, rastreador kaloniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a0a72e3-2311-4820-bebe-6c85cda2d011\', \'multiverseId\': 385636}, \'multiverseid\': 385636}, {\'name\': \'Ревущий Перводокс\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки верните существо под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Найти их довольно просто. Вопрос в том, а хотите ли вы?» — Джурук, калонский охотник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34002f39-a023-44d8-8ffe-c7585be22e17\', \'multiverseId\': 385920}, \'multiverseid\': 385920}, {\'name\': \'咆哮原跺兽\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，将一个由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「要找出它们很简单。问题是，你确定想找一个出来吗？」 ～卡隆尼亚追猎人裘鲁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08853c2-36fb-4efd-9e20-92e504d13fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 383648}, \'multiverseid\': 383648}, {\'name\': \'咆哮原跺獸\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，將一個由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「要找出牠們很簡單。問題是，你確定想找一個出來嗎？」 ～卡隆尼亞追獵人裘魯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8876e931-ab7a-4277-b6d5-43e198f0242b\', \'multiverseId\': 383932}, \'multiverseid\': 383932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Pyromeisterin\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Pyromeisterin, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt und bis zu einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Diese Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\n0: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\n-7: Schicke die obersten zehn Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bestimme eine auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte und kopiere sie dreimal. Du kannst die Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c644c4-2ae2-4e74-b911-d9560431f77e\', \'multiverseId\': 384056}, \'multiverseid\': 384056}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, piromaestra\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, piromaestra hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo y 1 punto de daño a hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador. Esa criatura no puede bloquear este turno.\\n0: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\\n-7: Exilia las diez primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Elige una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro exiliada de esta forma y cópiala tres veces. Puedes lanzar las copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3db896-15ca-493f-9107-e1a8ab61ea0c\', \'multiverseId\': 386044}, \'multiverseid\': 386044}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, pyromaîtresse\', \'text\': "+1 : Chandra, pyromaîtresse inflige 1 blessure à un joueur ciblé et 1 blessure à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle. Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\n0 : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.\\n−7 : Exilez les dix cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Choisissez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel exilée de cette manière et copiez-la trois fois. Vous pouvez lancer les copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86bd41cb-0fcd-40c2-95da-f940b98ca232\', \'multiverseId\': 384340}, \'multiverseid\': 384340}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Padrona del Fuoco\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli un giocatore bersaglio e fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore. Chandra, Padrona del Fuoco infligge 1 danno a quel giocatore e 1 danno a quella creatura. Quella creatura non può bloccare in questo turno.\\n0: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\\n-7: Esilia le prime dieci carte del tuo grimorio. Scegli una carta istantaneo o stregoneria esiliata in questo modo e copiala tre volte. Puoi lanciare le copie senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43c9f74-a0ce-4236-aa27-c98905700a73\', \'multiverseId\': 384624}, \'multiverseid\': 384624}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮の達人チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'＋１：プレイヤー１人と、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー最大１体までを対象とする。紅蓮の達人チャンドラはそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージと、そのクリーチャーに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\n０：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。このターン、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\n－７：あなたのライブラリーの一番上から10枚のカードを追放する。これにより追放されたインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚を選び、それを３回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2175b63-87d1-4737-8148-38ca3f28a3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 384908}, \'multiverseid\': 384908}, {\'name\': \'화염의 대가 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 플레이어 그리고 그 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 최대 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 화염의 대가 찬드라는 그 플레이어와 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\\n0: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\\n-7: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 열 장을 추방한다. 이런 식으로 추방한 카드 중 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 골라 그것을 세 번 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들을 마나 비용의 지불 없이 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f586f24-7efb-4629-8c42-146e6352dad4\', \'multiverseId\': 385192}, \'multiverseid\': 385192}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Piromestra\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Piromestra, causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador alvo e 1 ponto de dano a até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla. Aquela criatura não pode bloquear neste turno.\\n0: Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\\n-7: Exile os dez cards do topo de seu grimório. Escolha um card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço exilado desta forma e copie-o três vezes. Você pode conjurar as cópias sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8125bb44-7cac-4660-89c1-92ffc7160953\', \'multiverseId\': 385476}, \'multiverseid\': 385476}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Пиромастер\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра, Пиромастер наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку и 1 повреждение не более чем одному целевому существу под контролем того игрока. То существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\\n0: изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\\n-7: изгоните десять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Выберите карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства, изгнанную таким образом, и скопируйте ее три раза. Вы можете разыграть те копии без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cfe5d42-9cfd-4723-85b1-6a239e7d2301\', \'multiverseId\': 385760}, \'multiverseid\': 385760}, {\'name\': \'火焰大师茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：火焰大师茜卓对目标牌手造成1点伤害，且对至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物造成1点伤害。该生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n0：放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\\n-7：放逐你牌库顶的十张牌。选择一张以此法放逐的瞬间或法术牌，并将之复制三次。你可以施放这些复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef9cb61-1ff9-4d63-a6ee-81c48f66ecab\', \'multiverseId\': 383488}, \'multiverseid\': 383488}, {\'name\': \'火焰大師茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：火焰大師茜卓對目標玩家造成1點傷害，且對至多一個目標由該玩家操控的生物造成1點傷害。該生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\\n0：放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\\n-7：放逐你牌庫頂的十張牌。選擇一張以此法放逐的瞬間或巫術牌，並將之複製三次。你可以施放這些複製品，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8f828f3-f316-448f-8bb2-aa699e9c8320\', \'multiverseId\': 383772}, \'multiverseid\': 383772}]', "[{'name': 'Chronostottern', 'text': 'Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl als zweite Karte von oben in die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Alles zu seiner Zeit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384062&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c597806-87c4-40a2-b7f1-79a2b7c26c75', 'multiverseId': 384062}, 'multiverseid': 384062}, {'name': 'Inestabilidad cronológica', 'text': 'Pon la criatura objetivo en la biblioteca de su propietario en segundo lugar desde la parte superior.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'La coordinación lo es todo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386050&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f47c68e-c3cd-48bc-931c-ebbcdb56ad9b', 'multiverseId': 386050}, 'multiverseid': 386050}, {'name': 'Chronobalbutiement', 'text': 'Mettez la créature ciblée dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire en deuxième position à partir du dessus.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Tout est affaire de minutage.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384346&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49e5988a-f7a7-4aaf-982a-3c9b25966330', 'multiverseId': 384346}, 'multiverseid': 384346}, {'name': 'Discontinuità Temporale', 'text': 'Metti una creatura bersaglio nel grimorio del suo proprietario come seconda carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Il tempismo è fondamentale.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384630&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '222a151b-05df-41a8-a138-0c25d6326f93', 'multiverseId': 384630}, 'multiverseid': 384630}, {'name': '時間づまり', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上から２枚目に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'すべてはタイミング次第である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384914&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd85ec805-1b2c-45af-8701-a30918da1d50', 'multiverseId': 384914}, 'multiverseid': 384914}, {'name': '시간 지연기', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에서 두 번째에 넣는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '모든 것은 시기 선택에 달려있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385198&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f7f7eea-7307-4a92-b74b-8ce13cd62979', 'multiverseId': 385198}, 'multiverseid': 385198}, {'name': 'Instabilidade Cronológica', 'text': 'Coloque a criatura alvo no grimório do seu dono na segunda posição.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Encontrar o momento certo é crucial.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385482&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '915044b8-0163-4e29-a67f-e6f20928278c', 'multiverseId': 385482}, 'multiverseid': 385482}, {'name': 'Хронозаминка', 'text': 'Положите целевое существо в библиотеку его владельца вторым сверху.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Главное — правильно выбрать момент.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385766&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9002e32a-7aef-4fd5-afd3-893165659e23', 'multiverseId': 385766}, 'multiverseid': 385766}, {'name': '扰时迷术', 'text': '将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶数来第二张的位置。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '时机就是一切。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383494&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68d6af55-ea9a-4b4f-9867-893e8b33786b', 'multiverseId': 383494}, 'multiverseid': 383494}, {'name': '擾時迷術', 'text': '將目標生物置於其擁有者的牌庫頂數來第二張的位置。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '時機就是一切。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383778&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f70b4a7-d958-4e9e-bdc0-c41482aa5654', 'multiverseId': 383778}, 'multiverseid': 383778}]", "[{'name': 'Das Feuer anfachen', 'text': 'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Jede Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, reduziert dessen Kosten um {1} oder um ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nDas Feuer anfachen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384256&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed7cc451-f831-4faf-9fb0-9f9febc6c9d2', 'multiverseId': 384256}, 'multiverseid': 384256}, {'name': 'Avivar las llamas', 'text': 'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nAvivar las llamas hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386244&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3e8c4cc-d132-41cc-83b6-9d456079860a', 'multiverseId': 386244}, 'multiverseid': 386244}, {'name': 'Activer les flammes', 'text': 'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nActiver les flammes inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384540&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc12e78c-bd07-4e26-9849-3bdcc813fea6', 'multiverseId': 384540}, 'multiverseid': 384540}, {'name': 'Ravvivare le Fiamme', 'text': 'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nRavvivare le Fiamme infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384824&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd493000-806b-4c6d-b66c-9585ee212770', 'multiverseId': 384824}, 'multiverseid': 384824}, {'name': 'かき立てる炎', 'text': '召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。かき立てる炎はそれに４点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385108&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3468d9d1-e5b4-4605-a1f1-83ae48e8abd7', 'multiverseId': 385108}, 'multiverseid': 385108}, {'name': '불꽃 키우기', 'text': '집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동할 때 탭하는 생물 한 개당 이 주문의 비용은 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색인 마나 한 개만큼 줄어든다.)\\n생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 불꽃 키우기는 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385392&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca21b142-ac5f-4343-82d1-f83903b601fa', 'multiverseId': 385392}, 'multiverseid': 385392}, {'name': 'Atiçar as Chamas', 'text': 'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nAtiçar as Chamas causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385676&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9034cac0-9769-4d8f-af22-5c60abac6201', 'multiverseId': 385676}, 'multiverseid': 385676}, {'name': 'Раздувание Пламени', 'text': 'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nРаздувание Пламени наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385960&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acbe11ee-6c43-47f6-a6a3-70a7dc2a1e19', 'multiverseId': 385960}, 'multiverseid': 385960}, {'name': '鼓风煽焰', 'text': '召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n鼓风煽焰对目标生物或牌手造成4点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383688&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6827ef8-7180-4264-b84f-faa7dcc7fc7f', 'multiverseId': 383688}, 'multiverseid': 383688}, {'name': '鼓風煽焰', 'text': '召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n鼓風煽焰對目標生物或玩家造成4點傷害。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383972&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70fbc689-b8f0-47c9-8b93-3adca5884297', 'multiverseId': 383972}, 'multiverseid': 383972}]", '[{\'name\': \'Den Weg freimachen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Verteidiger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum sehen die Wachen immer so überrascht aus, wenn wir ihnen eins überbraten?", fragte Ruric. „Ich glaube, sie erwarten eine Bestechung", sagte Thar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba57cf0-d98d-4d9c-ac82-978be888a3d9\', \'multiverseId\': 384064}, \'multiverseid\': 384064}, {\'name\': \'Despejar un camino\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de defensor.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué los guardias siempre parecen sorprendidos cuando los golpeamos?", preguntó Ruric. "Creo que esperan un soborno", dijo Thar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c3e5205-6b77-497d-9117-1a0f8491821f\', \'multiverseId\': 386052}, \'multiverseid\': 386052}, {\'name\': \'Se frayer un chemin\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le défenseur ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi les gardes ont toujours l\'air surpris quand on les cogne ? » demanda Ruric. « Ils doivent s\'attendre à ce qu\'on leur graisse la patte » répondit Thar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384348&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e595f3-2fdc-4e14-8ee8-8367ad73bb4f\', \'multiverseId\': 384348}, \'multiverseid\': 384348}, {\'name\': \'Aprire un Varco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con difensore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché le guardie hanno sempre un\\\'aria sorpresa quando le pestiamo?" chiese Ruric. "Credo si aspettino che cerchiamo di corromperle" rispose Thar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5d8c2c-6d3c-466b-81c1-ba4a861aa6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 384632}, \'multiverseid\': 384632}, {\'name\': \'障害排除\', \'text\': \'防衛を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「衛兵はぶん殴られると、なんでびっくりした顔をするんだ？」ルーリクが訊いた。 サーは答えた。 「ワイロをもらえるとでも思ってたんだろ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215617f1-92bf-4b33-9d42-ccca2527d436\', \'multiverseId\': 384916}, \'multiverseid\': 384916}, {\'name\': \'길을 비켜라\', \'text\': \'수비태세를 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"경비병들이 왜 맞으면서 놀랐지?" 루릭이 물었다. 타르가 대답했다. "일단 뇌물을 먼저 주는 게 관행인가 봐."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44827f34-1479-49da-b65e-723b29eeaf4a\', \'multiverseId\': 385200}, \'multiverseid\': 385200}, {\'name\': \'Abrir Caminho\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com defensor.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que os guardas sempre parecem surpresos quando a gente bate neles?" , perguntou Ruric. "Acho que eles esperam um suborno", respondeu Thar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eeac61e-56db-45b2-a4dc-b03e8a318e14\', \'multiverseId\': 385484}, \'multiverseid\': 385484}, {\'name\': \'Расчистить Путь\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо со способностью Защитника.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Почему у стражников всегда такой удивленный вид, когда мы их бьем?» — спросил Рурик. «Наверное, они ждут взятки, а не драки», — ответил Тар.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a46e300-5396-44f4-a137-66e85ed1bc92\', \'multiverseId\': 385768}, \'multiverseid\': 385768}, {\'name\': \'杀出血路\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具守军异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「为什么我们每次揍守卫时他们都满脸惊讶？」鲁瑞问道。 杂尔回答：「他们大概以为我们要送钱吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37064ded-e952-4648-8e7d-e6d20efc34ee\', \'multiverseId\': 383496}, \'multiverseid\': 383496}, {\'name\': \'殺出血路\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具守軍異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「為什麼我們每次揍守衛時他們都滿臉驚訝？」魯瑞問道。 雜爾回答：「他們大概以為我們要送錢吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa67c29-7530-4e83-8fbe-be2ac28f8903\', \'multiverseId\': 383780}, \'multiverseid\': 383780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Kettenschleier\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug keine Loyalitätsfähigkeit eines Planeswalkers aktiviert hast, verlierst du 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n{4}, {T}: Für jeden Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, kannst du einmal in diesem Zug eine seiner Loyalitätsfähigkeiten aktivieren, als ob in diesem Zug keine seiner Loyalitätsfähigkeiten aktiviert worden wären.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'854ee7c5-7356-4c91-a430-a1b9e6248d6f\', \'multiverseId\': 384264}, \'multiverseid\': 384264}, {\'name\': \'El Velo de Cadenas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si no activaste una habilidad de lealtad de un planeswalker este turno, pierdes 2 vidas.\\n{4}, {T}: Por cada planeswalker que controlas, puedes activar una de sus habilidades de lealtad una vez este turno como si no se hubiera activado ninguna de sus habilidades de lealtad este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3db30f-0254-4781-b412-968197ce7a60\', \'multiverseId\': 386252}, \'multiverseid\': 386252}, {\'name\': \'Le Voile de Chaîne\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous n\'avez activé aucune capacité de loyauté de planeswalker ce tour-ci, vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n{4}, {T} : Pour chaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez activer une de ses capacités de loyauté une fois ce tour-ci comme si aucune de ses capacités de loyauté n\'avait été activée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a78d81c-9076-416e-87eb-0a6a5d33e3d9\', \'multiverseId\': 384548}, \'multiverseid\': 384548}, {\'name\': \'Il Velo di Catena\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se non hai attivato un\'abilità di fedeltà di un planeswalker in questo turno, perdi 2 punti vita.\\n{4}, {T}: Per ogni planeswalker che controlli, puoi attivare una delle sue abilità di fedeltà per una volta in questo turno come se non fosse stata attivata alcuna delle sue abilità di fedeltà in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13a5f742-9625-4363-a8cd-739535b0e66b\', \'multiverseId\': 384832}, \'multiverseid\': 384832}, {\'name\': \'鎖のヴェール\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターン、あなたがプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力を起動させていなかった場合、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\\n{4}, {T}：あなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカー１体につき、このターン、あなたはそのプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力が起動されていなかったかのようにそれの忠誠度能力１つを１回起動してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'256c54c3-0a38-4ad9-9f61-b545162169bf\', \'multiverseId\': 385116}, \'multiverseid\': 385116}, {\'name\': \'사슬 베일\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 이 턴에 플레인즈워커의 충성 능력을 활성화하지 않았다면, 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다.\\n{4}, {T}: 당신은 이 턴에 당신이 조종하는 각 플레인즈워커의 충성 능력을 활성화하지 않은 것처럼 플레인즈워커의 충성 능력 중 한 개를 한 번씩 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03db22bf-280e-4245-a4d8-ab3456d03d75\', \'multiverseId\': 385400}, \'multiverseid\': 385400}, {\'name\': \'O Véu Metálico\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você não tiver ativado uma habilidade de lealdade de um planeswalker neste turno, você perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n{4}, {T}: Para cada planeswalker que você controla, você pode ativar uma de suas habilidades de lealdade neste turno uma vez como se nenhuma de suas habilidades de lealdade tivesse sido ativada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664b5429-b8f4-496c-a2b3-01f9a42c0869\', \'multiverseId\': 385684}, \'multiverseid\': 385684}, {\'name\': \'Кольчужная Завеса\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если вы не активировали способность верности planeswalker-а в этом ходу, вы теряете 2 жизни.\\n{4}, {T}: для каждого planeswalker-а под вашим контролем вы можете активировать одну из его способностей верности один раз в этом ходу, как если бы в этом ходу ни одна из его способностей верности не была активирована.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bf127d7-0465-4e81-93a8-6506c9dc46f4\', \'multiverseId\': 385968}, \'multiverseid\': 385968}, {\'name\': \'锁链面纱\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中你未起动过鹏洛客的忠诚异能，则你失去2点生命。\\n{4}，{T}：对每个由你操控的鹏洛客而言，于本回合中，你能起动一次该鹏洛客上的任一忠诚异能，且能视同此回合未起动过其忠诚异能地来起动之。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76af6df-dee6-4c2a-8ecc-1a54540ac029\', \'multiverseId\': 383696}, \'multiverseid\': 383696}, {\'name\': \'鎖鏈面紗\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中你未起動過鵬洛客的忠誠異能，則你失去2點生命。\\n{4}，{T}：對每個由你操控的鵬洛客而言，於本回合中，你能起動一次該鵬洛客上的任一忠誠異能，且能視同此回合未起動過其忠誠異能地來起動之。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028ad82c-d9e9-4cf1-880f-470dd2f669cb\', \'multiverseId\': 383980}, \'multiverseid\': 383980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schwachen jagen\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Dann kämpft diese Kreatur gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede dieser Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer zögert, wird verspeist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9662c246-94bb-4c43-b16e-4b96e809ce94\', \'multiverseId\': 384122}, \'multiverseid\': 384122}, {\'name\': \'Cazar a los débiles\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Después, esa criatura lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El que duda se convierte en almuerzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f59efdc-e5c9-4e42-95a9-e627ff716b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 386110}, \'multiverseid\': 386110}, {\'name\': \'Chasse aux plus faibles\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Cette créature se bat ensuite contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Hésiter, c\'est s\'offrir en pâture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14271b1f-c461-4d8a-ad08-f07927475fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 384406}, \'multiverseid\': 384406}, {\'name\': \'Cacciare i Deboli\', \'text\': "Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Poi quella creatura lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Chi si ferma è cibo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228bcc06-7eb2-48a8-974a-c314826cc966\', \'multiverseId\': 384690}, \'multiverseid\': 384690}, {\'name\': \'弱者狩り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ためらう者は昼食となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'405f6d48-3196-4466-96f8-5367f11aa9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 384974}, \'multiverseid\': 384974}, {\'name\': \'약자는 먹이로\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그런 다음 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'망설이는 놈은 먹이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2f7166-8446-40a2-a5c5-aa3649b94012\', \'multiverseId\': 385258}, \'multiverseid\': 385258}, {\'name\': \'Caçar os Fracos\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. Depois, aquela criatura luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Aquele que hesita vira almoço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c09c5c1-fe6d-4a08-a27b-bac86af5dc9f\', \'multiverseId\': 385542}, \'multiverseid\': 385542}, {\'name\': \'Охота на Слабых\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем. Затем то существо дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Эти существа наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Кто последний, того на обед!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9231aa8-947c-459d-9d04-49f269e9cad9\', \'multiverseId\': 385826}, \'multiverseid\': 385826}, {\'name\': \'猎捕弱者\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后该生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'只要犹豫，即成食物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef244bd4-5789-426d-8842-19515f08c3a7\', \'multiverseId\': 383554}, \'multiverseid\': 383554}, {\'name\': \'獵捕弱者\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。然後該生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'只要猶豫，即成食物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e2d4b63-cc5b-414a-a5e3-ef31971edd50\', \'multiverseId\': 383838}, \'multiverseid\': 383838}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerriese\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Den Riesen konnte man einige Sekunden lang schon spüren, bevor er in Sicht kam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb738e91-988c-4e46-ab8d-f9a3a755475d\', \'multiverseId\': 384265}, \'multiverseid\': 384265}, {\'name\': \'Gigante descomunal\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Se sintió al gigante varios segundos antes de que se lo viera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30327cc5-963a-45db-a554-9c8ef7da99f6\', \'multiverseId\': 386253}, \'multiverseid\': 386253}, {\'name\': \'Géant fulminant\', \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "On ressentit l\'approche du géant avant de le voir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b2a3867-fc1a-405d-bfa6-ab2285714a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 384549}, \'multiverseid\': 384549}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Tonante\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Il gigante fu udito alcuni secondi prima di essere visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6435a24d-56db-4a16-9b19-0a7c5a250355\', \'multiverseId\': 384833}, \'multiverseid\': 384833}, {\'name\': \'轟きの巨人\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'巨人が現れるとき、姿が見える二、三秒前にそれを感じることができた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b67c11c-49dc-49b7-8570-848ecdd287b2\', \'multiverseId\': 385117}, \'multiverseid\': 385117}, {\'name\': \'천둥 거인\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'보이기 몇 초 전부터 그 거인을 느낄 수 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e74ae00-95e0-44dc-ab7c-2dd018ea1bae\', \'multiverseId\': 385401}, \'multiverseid\': 385401}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que passa ao seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'O gigante foi sentido alguns segundos antes de ser visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea86eac1-685c-400d-9e2f-70477d035a56\', \'multiverseId\': 385685}, \'multiverseid\': 385685}, {\'name\': \'Громыхающий Гигант\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Приближение гиганта почувствовали еще за несколько секунд до того, как его стало видно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242e125c-a157-4579-ab2d-f3accdc2ed51\', \'multiverseId\': 385969}, \'multiverseid\': 385969}, {\'name\': \'雷动巨人\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'巨人出现前几秒，你就能感觉到他。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa53015-8285-4975-bcfa-b3d6d33f8106\', \'multiverseId\': 383697}, \'multiverseid\': 383697}, {\'name\': \'雷動巨人\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'巨人出現前幾秒，你就能感覺到他。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f2d24f-fcb5-4da2-9d65-b4cc8c4b6d88\', \'multiverseId\': 383981}, \'multiverseid\': 383981}]', "[{'name': 'Dreifachgeister', 'text': 'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Jede Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, reduziert dessen Kosten um {1} oder um ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nBringe drei 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel. (Sie können außer von fliegenden Kreaturen und Kreaturen mit Reichweite nicht geblockt werden.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384270&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c6756f1-3fda-4760-9f63-ba40c92c1768', 'multiverseId': 384270}, 'multiverseid': 384270}, {'name': 'Espíritu triplicado', 'text': 'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nPon en el campo de batalla tres fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. (No pueden ser bloqueadas excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar o alcance.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386258&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b6f7cdd-b918-4a62-a648-9fd1472c0762', 'multiverseId': 386258}, 'multiverseid': 386258}, {'name': 'Esprits triplets', 'text': 'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nMettez sur le champ de bataille trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol. (Ils ne peuvent pas être bloqués excepté par des créatures avec le vol ou la portée.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384554&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46013885-538e-4f6d-b221-bf1acd412397', 'multiverseId': 384554}, 'multiverseid': 384554}, {'name': 'Triplicare gli Spiriti', 'text': 'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nMetti sul campo di battaglia tre pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 bianche con volare. (Non possono essere bloccate tranne che da creature con volare o raggiungere.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384838&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '596ef904-d449-4526-aa43-354797252c9a', 'multiverseId': 384838}, 'multiverseid': 384838}, {'name': '三つぞろいの霊魂', 'text': '召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。（それらは飛行や到達を持たないクリーチャーによってブロックされない。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385122&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb14f4b9-243f-42f6-aec7-2138d7380817', 'multiverseId': 385122}, 'multiverseid': 385122}, {'name': '세 번 절하는 신령들', 'text': '집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동할 때 탭하는 생물 한 개당 이 주문의 비용은 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색인 마나 한 개만큼 줄어든다.)\\n비행을 가진 1/1 백색 신령 생물 토큰 세 개를 전장에 놓는다. (이 토큰들은 비행이나 대공을 가진 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385406&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ecd2bdb-0232-473d-ad6a-8f22f5a4c0cd', 'multiverseId': 385406}, 'multiverseid': 385406}, {'name': 'Triplicar Espíritos', 'text': 'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nColoque no campo de batalha três fichas de criatura brancas 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar. (Elas só podem ser bloqueadas por criaturas com voar ou alcance.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385690&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7abfece3-8844-4c4b-9009-b1f145ccba7b', 'multiverseId': 385690}, 'multiverseid': 385690}, {'name': 'Утроение Духа', 'text': 'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nПоложите на поле битвы три фишки существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом. (Они могут быть заблокированы только существами с Полетом или Захватом.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385974&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00107644-054f-491d-ac7e-46c1f69fff2a', 'multiverseId': 385974}, 'multiverseid': 385974}, {'name': '三联精怪', 'text': '召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n将三个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。（它们只能被具飞行或延势异能的生物阻挡。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383702&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d91cba1-7c87-4571-8e5c-caba4b6f6190', 'multiverseId': 383702}, 'multiverseid': 383702}, {'name': '三聯精靈', 'text': '召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n將三個1/1白色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物放進戰場。（它們只能被具飛行或延勢異能的生物阻擋。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383986&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73191348-a59c-4ba8-930c-c5df29b65451', 'multiverseId': 383986}, 'multiverseid': 383986}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duldsamer Peiniger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZiehe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Karte, falls nicht ein Gegner deiner Wahl eine Kreatur opfert oder 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Die Aussicht auf Qualen ist Lohn genug für geleistete Dienste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bcf5060-dc6e-4870-ae2d-7b091e314720\', \'multiverseId\': 384128}, \'multiverseid\': 384128}, {\'name\': \'Atormentador indulgente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, roba una carta a menos que el oponente objetivo sacrifique una criatura o pague 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'La promesa del dolor es pago suficiente por los servicios prestados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=386116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebd50bf-0d84-48e8-b393-d3e537fa8880\', \'multiverseId\': 386116}, \'multiverseid\': 386116}, {\'name\': \'Persécuteur indulgent\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, piochez une carte à moins que l\'adversaire ciblé ne sacrifie une créature ou ne paie 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "La promesse d\'angoisse suffit en règlement des services rendus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd95cf8-d4e9-49b0-99b9-d2a4c11b73c0\', \'multiverseId\': 384412}, \'multiverseid\': 384412}, {\'name\': \'Torturatore Indulgente\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, pesca una carta a meno che un avversario bersaglio non sacrifichi una creatura o paghi 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': "La promessa dell\'agonia è una ricompensa sufficiente per i servizi resi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5457ab6-9495-4676-a323-5162570a5232\', \'multiverseId\': 384696}, \'multiverseid\': 384696}, {\'name\': \'寛大な拷問者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げるかライフを３点支払わないかぎり、あなたはカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'提供した奉仕の対価として、苦悩の約束は十分すぎるほどである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=384980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7e90b3-45c8-4006-a192-73210548fe0c\', \'multiverseId\': 384980}, \'multiverseid\': 384980}, {\'name\': \'너그러운 고문관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 생물 한 개를 희생하거나 생명 3점을 지불하지 않으면 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'괴로움을 겪는다는 생각만으로 충분하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede8121f-7217-42ca-822d-f47a142df9c1\', \'multiverseId\': 385264}, \'multiverseid\': 385264}, {\'name\': \'Algoz Indulgente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, compre um card a menos que o oponente alvo sacrifique uma criatura ou pague 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'A promessa de agonia é pagamento suficiente por seus serviços prestados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16846089-339b-471f-8593-38414177008e\', \'multiverseId\': 385548}, \'multiverseid\': 385548}, {\'name\': \'Снисходительный Мучитель\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки возьмите карту, если только целевой оппонент не пожертвует существо или не заплатит 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Обещание страданий — достаточная плата за оказанные услуги.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=385832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d913a95-daca-412a-8c98-9e639af3860e\', \'multiverseId\': 385832}, \'multiverseid\': 385832}, {\'name\': \'放纵拷问魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，除非目标对手牺牲一个生物或支付3点生命，否则你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'对痛苦的承诺足以成为服务的报酬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eeb57e8-1fea-4cfb-bcc6-d08c9c9e5e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 383560}, \'multiverseid\': 383560}, {\'name\': \'放縱拷問魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的維持開始時，除非目標對手犧牲一個生物或支付3點生命，否則你抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'對痛苦的承諾足以成為服務的報酬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=383844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff7f8de6-985d-44d0-bf92-778647a99a00\', \'multiverseId\': 383844}, \'multiverseid\': 383844}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor'